  result.add "\x22,\x22gamerule.enderPearlsVanishOnDeath.description\x22:\x22Whether Ender Pearls thrown by a player vanish when that player dies.\x22,\x22gamerule.entitiesWithPassengersCanUsePortals\x22:\x22Entities with passengers can use portals\x22,\x22gamerule.entitiesWithPassengersCanUsePortals.description\x22:\x22Allow entities with passengers to teleport through Nether Portals, End Portals, and End Gateways.\x22,\x22gamerule.fallDamage\x22:\x22Deal fall damage\x22,\x22gamerule.fireDamage\x22:\x22Deal fire damage\x22,\x22gamerule.forgiveDeadPlayers\x22:\x22Forgive dead players\x22,\x22gamerule.forgiveDeadPlayers.description\x22:\x22Angered neutral mobs stop being angry when the targeted player dies nearby.\x22,\x22gamerule.freezeDamage\x22:\x22Deal freeze damage\x22,\x22gamerule.globalSoundEvents\x22:\x22Global sound events\x22,\x22gamerule.globalSoundEvents.description\x22:\x22When certain game events happen, like a boss spawning, the sound is heard everywhere.\x22,\x22gamerule.keepInventory\x22:\x22Keep inventory after death\x22,\x22gamerule.lavaSourceConversion\x22:\x22Lava converts to source\x22,\x22gamerule.lavaSourceConversion.description\x22:\x22When flowing lava is surrounded on two sides by lava sources, it converts into a source.\x22,\x22gamerule.locatorBar\x22:\x22Enable player Locator Bar\x22,\x22gamerule.locatorBar.description\x22:\x22When enabled, a bar is shown on the screen to indicate the direction of players.\x22,\x22gamerule.logAdminCommands\x22:\x22Broadcast admin commands\x22,\x22gamerule.maxCommandChainLength\x22:\x22Command chain size limit\x22,\x22gamerule.maxCommandChainLength.description\x22:\x22Applies to command block chains and functions.\x22,\x22gamerule.maxCommandForkCount\x22:\x22Command context limit\x22,\x22gamerule.maxCommandForkCount.description\x22:\x22Maximum number of contexts that can be used by commands like 'execute as'.\x22,\x22gamerule.maxEntityCramming\x22:\x22Entity cramming threshold\x22,\x22gamerule.minecartMaxSpeed\x22:\x22Minecart max speed\x22,\x22gamerule.minecartMaxSpeed.description\x22:\x22Maximum default speed of a moving Minecart on land.\x22,\x22gamerule.minecraft.elytra_movement_check\x22:\x22Do elytra movement check\x22,\x22gamerule.minecraft.fire_spread_radius_around_player\x22:\x22Fire spread radius\x22,\x22gamerule.minecraft.fire_spread_radius_around_player.description\x22:\x22The radius in blocks around a player in which fire can spread\x22,\x22gamerule.minecraft.player_movement_check\x22:\x22Do player movement check\x22,\x22gamerule.minecraft.raids\x22:\x22Do raids\x22,\x22gamerule.minecraft.universal_anger.description\x22:\x22Angered neutral mobs attack any nearby player, not just the player that angered them. Works best if forgive_dead_players is disabled.\x22,\x22gamerule.mobExplosionDropDecay\x22:\x22In mob explosions, some blocks won't drop their loot\x22,\x22gamerule.mobExplosionDropDecay.description\x22:\x22Some of the drops from blocks destroyed by explosions caused by mobs are lost in the explosion.\x22,\x22gamerule.mobGriefing\x22:\x22Allow destructive mob actions\x22,\x22gamerule.naturalRegeneration\x22:\x22Regenerate health\x22,\x22gamerule.playersNetherPortalCreativeDelay\x22:\x22Player's Nether Portal delay in creative mode\x22,\x22gamerule.playersNetherPortalCreativeDelay.description\x22:\x22Time (in ticks) that a creative mode player needs to stand in a Nether Portal before changing dimensions.\x22,\x22gamerule.playersNetherPortalDefaultDelay\x22:\x22Player's Nether Portal delay in non-creative mode\x22,\x22gamerule.playersNetherPortalDefaultDelay.description\x22:\x22Time (in ticks) that a non-creative mode player needs to stand in a Nether Portal before changing dimensions.\x22,\x22gamerule.playersSleepingPercentage\x22:\x22Sleep percentage\x22,\x22gamerule.playersSleepingPercentage.description\x22:\x22The percentage of players who must be sleeping to skip the night.\x22,\x22gamerule.projectilesCanBreakBlocks\x22:\x22Projectiles can break blocks\x22,\x22gamerule.projectilesCanBreakBlocks.description\x22:\x22Controls whether impact projectiles will destroy blocks that are destructible by them.\x22,\x22gamerule.pvp\x22:\x22Enable pvp\x22,\x22gamerule.pvp.description\x22:\x22Controls whether players are allowed to damage other players.\x22,\x22gamerule.randomTickSpeed\x22:\x22Random tick speed rate\x22,\x22gamerule.reducedDebugInfo\x22:\x22Reduce debug info\x22,\x22gamerule.reducedDebugInfo.description\x22:\x22Limits contents of debug screen.\x22,\x22gamerule.sendCommandFeedback\x22:\x22Send command feedback\x22,\x22gamerule.showDeathMessages\x22:\x22Show death messages\x22,\x22gamerule.snowAccumulationHeight\x22:\x22Snow accumulation height\x22,\x22gamerule.snowAccumulationHeight.description\x22:\x22When it snows, layers of snow form on the ground up to at most this number of layers.\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnChunkRadius\x22:\x22Spawn chunk radius\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnChunkRadius.description\x22:\x22The amount of chunks that stay loaded around the overworld spawn position.\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnerBlocksEnabled\x22:\x22Enable Spawner Blocks\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnMonsters\x22:\x22Spawn Monsters\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnMonsters.description\x22:\x22Controls whether monsters naturally spawn.\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnRadius\x22:\x22Respawn location radius\x22,\x22gamerule.spawnRadius.description\x22:\x22Controls the size of the area around the spawn point that players can spawn in.\x22,\x22gamerule.spectatorsGenerateChunks\x22:\x22Allow spectators to generate terrain\x22,\x22gamerule.tntExplodes\x22:\x22Allow TNT to be activated and to explode\x22,\x22gamerule.tntExplosionDropDecay\x22:\x22In TNT explosions, some blocks won't drop their loot\x22,\x22gamerule.tntExplosionDropDecay.description\x22:\x22Some of the drops from blocks destroyed by explosions caused by TNT are lost in the explosion.\x22,\x22gamerule.universalAnger\x22:\x22Universal anger\x22,\x22gamerule.universalAnger.description\x22:\x22Angered neutral mobs attack any nearby player, not just the player that angered them. Works best if forgiveDeadPlayers is disabled.\x22,\x22gamerule.waterSourceConversion\x22:\x22Water converts to source\x22,\x22gamerule.waterSourceConversion.description\x22:\x22When flowing water is surrounded on two sides by water sources, it converts into a source.\x22,\x22generator.custom\x22:\x22Custom\x22,\x22generator.customized\x22:\x22Old Customized\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.amplified\x22:\x22AMPLIFIED\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.amplified.info\x22:\x22Notice: Just for fun! Requires a beefy computer.\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.debug_all_block_states\x22:\x22Debug Mode\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.flat\x22:\x22Superflat\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.flat_all_dimensions\x22:\x22Flat All Dimensions\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.large_biomes\x22:\x22Large Biomes\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.normal\x22:\x22Default\x22,\x22generator.minecraft.single_biome_surface\x22:\x22Single Biome\x22,\x22generator.single_biome_caves\x22:\x22Caves\x22,\x22generator.single_biome_floating_islands\x22:\x22Floating Islands\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.attestation\x22:\x22By submitting this report, you confirm that the information you have provided is accurate and complete to the best of your knowledge.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.comments\x22:\x22Comments\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.describe\x22:\x22Sharing details will help us make a well-informed decision.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.discard.content\x22:\x22If you leave, you'll lose this report and your comments.\x5cnAre you sure you want to leave?\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.discard.discard\x22:\x22Leave and Discard Report\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.discard.draft\x22:\x22Save as Draft\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.discard.return\x22:\x22Continue Editing\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.discard.title\x22:\x22Discard Report and Comments?\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.draft.content\x22:\x22Would you like to continue editing the existing report or discard it and create a new one?\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.draft.dis