  result.add "on.child_sexual_exploitation_or_abuse.description\x22:\x22Someone is talking about or otherwise promoting indecent behavior involving children.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.defamation_impersonation_false_information\x22:\x22Defamation\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.defamation_impersonation_false_information.description\x22:\x22Someone is damaging your or someone else's reputation, for example sharing false information with the aim to exploit or mislead others.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.description\x22:\x22Description:\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.false_reporting\x22:\x22False Reporting\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.generic\x22:\x22I want to report them\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.generic.description\x22:\x22I'm annoyed with them / they have done something I do not like.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.harassment_or_bullying\x22:\x22Harassment or bullying\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.harassment_or_bullying.description\x22:\x22Someone is shaming, attacking, or bullying you or someone else. This includes when someone is repeatedly trying to contact you or someone else without consent or posting private personal information about you or someone else without consent (\x5c\x22doxing\x5c\x22).\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.hate_speech\x22:\x22Hate speech\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.hate_speech.description\x22:\x22Someone is attacking you or another player based on characteristics of their identity, like religion, race, or sexuality.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.imminent_harm\x22:\x22Threat of harm to others\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.imminent_harm.description\x22:\x22Someone is threatening to harm you or someone else in real life.\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.narration\x22:\x22%s: %s\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.non_consensual_intimate_imagery\x22:\x22Non-consensual intimate imagery\x22,\x22gui.abuseReport.reason.non_consensual_intimate_imagery.description\x22:\x22Someone is talking about, sharing, or otherwise promoting private an