onds chunks should fade in when they're first rendered, if at all.\x22,\x22options.chunks\x22:\x22%s Chunks\x22,\x22options.clouds.fancy\x22:\x22Fancy\x22,\x22options.clouds.fast\x22:\x22Fast\x22,\x22options.controls\x22:\x22Controls...\x22,\x22options.credits_and_attribution\x22:\x22Credits & Attribution...\x22,\x22options.cutoutLeaves\x22:\x22See-Through Leaves\x22,\x22options.cutoutLeaves.tooltip\x22:\x22Allows you to see through gaps in leaves. Disabling improves performance.\x22,\x22options.damageTiltStrength\x22:\x22Damage Tilt\x22,\x22options.damageTiltStrength.tooltip\x22:\x22The amount of camera shake caused by being hurt.\x22,\x22options.darkMojangStudiosBackgroundColor\x22:\x22Monochrome Logo\x22,\x22options.darkMojangStudiosBackgroundColor.tooltip\x22:\x22Changes the Mojang Studios loading screen background color to black.\x22,\x22options.darknessEffectScale\x22:\x22Darkness Pulsing\x22,\x22options.darknessEffectScale.tooltip\x22:\x22Controls how much the Darkness effect pulses when a Warden or Sculk Shrieker gives it to you.\x22,\x22options.difficulty\x22:\x22Difficulty\x22,\x22options.difficulty.easy\x22:\x22Easy\x22,\x22options.difficulty.easy.info\x22:\x22Hostile mobs spawn but deal less damage. Hunger bar depletes and drains health down to 5 hearts.\x22,\x22options.difficulty.hard\x22:\x22Hard\x22,\x22options.difficulty.hard.info\x22:\x22Hostile mobs spawn and deal more damage. Hunger bar depletes and drains all health.\x22,\x22options.difficulty.hardcore\x22:\x22Hardcore\x22,\x22options.difficulty.normal\x22:\x22Normal\x22,\x22options.difficulty.normal.info\x22:\x22Hostile mobs spawn and deal standard damage. Hunger bar depletes and drains health down to half a heart.\x22,\x22options.difficulty.online\x22:\x22Server Difficulty\x22,\x22options.difficulty.peaceful\x22:\x22Peaceful\x22,\x22options.difficulty.peaceful.info\x22:\x22No hostile mobs and only some neutral mobs spawn. Hunger bar doesn't deplete and health replenishes over time.\x22,\x22opti