ats.\x5cnWith this option on, hidden players will be matched based on chat sender names.\x22,\x22options.hideSplashTexts\x22:\x22Hide Splash Texts\x22,\x22options.hideSplashTexts.tooltip\x22:\x22Hides the yellow splash text in the main menu.\x22,\x22options.improvedTransparency\x22:\x22Improved Transparency\x22,\x22options.improvedTransparency.tooltip\x22:\x22An experimental approach that uses screen shaders for drawing weather, clouds, and particles behind translucent blocks and water.\x5cnThis will impact GPU performance.\x22,\x22options.inactivityFpsLimit\x22:\x22Reduce FPS when\x22,\x22options.inactivityFpsLimit.afk\x22:\x22AFK\x22,\x22options.inactivityFpsLimit.afk.tooltip\x22:\x22Limits framerate to 30 when the game is not getting any player input for more than a minute. Further limits it to 10 after 9 more minutes.\x22,\x22options.inactivityFpsLimit.minimized\x22:\x22Minimized\x22,\x22options.inactivityFpsLimit.minimized.tooltip\x22:\x22Limits framerate only when the game window is minimized.\x22,\x22options.inGameNotification\x22:\x22In-Game Notification\x22,\x22options.inGameNotification.tooltip\x22:\x22Show Friend notifications in-game\x22,\x22options.invertMouse\x22:\x22Invert Mouse\x22,\x22options.invertMouseX\x22:\x22Invert Mouse X\x22,\x22options.invertMouseY\x22:\x22Invert Mouse Y\x22,\x22options.japaneseGlyphVariants\x22:\x22Japanese Glyph Variants\x22,\x22options.japaneseGlyphVariants.tooltip\x22:\x22Uses Japanese variants of CJK characters in the default font.\x22,\x22options.key.hold\x22:\x22Hold\x22,\x22options.key.toggle\x22:\x22Toggle\x22,\x22options.language\x22:\x22Language...\x22,\x22options.language.narration\x22:\x22Change Language\x22,\x22options.language.title\x22:\x22Language\x22,\x22options.language.tooltip\x22:\x22Change Language\x22,\x22options.languageAccuracyWarning\x22:\x22(Language translations may not be 100%% accurate)\x22,\x22options.languageWarning\x22:\x22Language translations may not be 100%% accurate\x22,\x22options.mainHand\x22:\x22Main Hand\x22,\x22options.mainHand.left\x22:\x22Left\x22,\x22options.mainHand.right\x22:\x22Right\x22,\x22options.maxAnisotropy\x22:\x22Anisotropic Filtering\x22,\x22options.maxAnisotropy.tooltip\x22:\x22Each level significantly improves how smooth textures look, but impacts performance and significantly impacts video memory usage. Requires Texture Filtering to be set to Anisotropic.\x22,\x22options.mipmapLevels\x22:\x22Mipmap Levels\x22,\x22options.modelPart.cape\x22:\x22Cape\x22,\x22options.modelPart.hat\x22:\x22Hat\x22,\x22options.modelPart.jacket\x22:\x22Jacket\x22,\x22options.modelPart.left_pants_leg\x22:\x22Left Pant Leg\x22,\x22options.modelPart.left_sleeve\x22:\x22Left Sleeve\x22,\x22options.modelPart.right_pants_leg\x22:\x22Right Pant Leg\x22,\x22options.modelPart.right_sleeve\x22:\x22Right Sleeve\x22,\x22options.mouse_settings\x22:\x22Mouse Settings...\x22,\x22options.mouse_settings.title\x22:\x22Mouse Settings\x22,\x22options.mouseWheelSensitivity\x22:\x22Scroll Sensitivity\x22,\x22options.multiplayer.title\x22:\x22Open to LAN\x22,\x22options.multiplier\x22:\x22%sx\x22,\x22options.music_frequency\x22:\x22Music Frequency\x22,\x22options.music_frequency.constant\x22:\x22Constant\x22,\x22options.music_frequency.default\x22:\x22Default\x22,\x22options.music_frequency.frequent\x22:\x22Frequent\x22,\x22options.music_frequency.tooltip\x22:\x22Changes how frequently music plays while in a game world.\x22,\x22options.musicToast\x22:\x22Music Toast\x22,\x22options.musicToast.never\x22:\x22Never\x22,\x22options.musicToast.never.tooltip\x22:\x22No music toast is shown.\x22,\x22options.musicToast.pauseMenu\x22:\x22Pause Menu\x22,\x22options.musicToast.pauseMenu.tooltip\x22:\x22A music toast is constantly displayed in the in-game pause menu while a song is playing.\x22,\x22options.musicToast.pauseMenuAndToast\x22:\x22Pause Menu and Toast\x22,\x22options.musicToast.pauseMenuAndToast.tooltip\x22:\x22Displays a toast when a song starts playing. The same toast i