he chunk immediately. This includes block placing & destroying.\x22,\x22options.prioritizeChunkUpdates.nearby\x22:\x22Fully Blocking\x22,\x22options.prioritizeChunkUpdates.nearby.tooltip\x22:\x22Nearby chunks are always compiled immediately. This may impact game performance when blocks are placed or destroyed.\x22,\x22options.prioritizeChunkUpdates.none\x22:\x22Threaded\x22,\x22options.prioritizeChunkUpdates.none.tooltip\x22:\x22Nearby chunks are compiled in parallel threads. This may result in brief visual holes when blocks are destroyed.\x22,\x22options.rawMouseInput\x22:\x22Raw Input\x22,\x22options.realmsNotifications\x22:\x22Realms News & Invites\x22,\x22options.realmsNotifications.button\x22:\x22News & Invites\x22,\x22options.realmsNotifications.tooltip\x22:\x22Fetches Realms news and invites in the title screen and displays their respective icon on the Realms button.\x22,\x22options.reducedDebugInfo\x22:\x22Reduced Debug Info\x22,\x22options.renderClouds\x22:\x22Clouds\x22,\x22options.renderCloudsDistance\x22:\x22Cloud Distance\x22,\x22options.renderDistance\x22:\x22Render Distance\x22,\x22options.resourcepack\x22:\x22Resource Packs...\x22,\x22options.restartRequired\x22:\x22Some of your changes require a game restart to be applied.\x22,\x22options.rotateWithMinecart\x22:\x22Rotate with Minecarts\x22,\x22options.rotateWithMinecart.tooltip\x22:\x22Whether the player's view should rotate with a turning Minecart. Only available in worlds with the 'Minecart Improvements' experimental setting turned on.\x22,\x22options.screenEffectScale\x22:\x22Distortion Effects\x22,\x22options.screenEffectScale.tooltip\x22:\x22Strength of Nausea and Nether Portal screen distortion effects.\x5cnAt lower values, the Nausea e"
