e.minimal\x22:\x22Minimal\x22,\x22options.telemetry.state.none\x22:\x22None\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering\x22:\x22Texture Filtering\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering.anisotropic\x22:\x22Anisotropic\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering.anisotropic.tooltip\x22:\x22A hardware-based filtering method, but impacts performance and significantly impacts video memory usage. May not be supported on all hardware.\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering.none\x22:\x22None\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering.none.tooltip\x22:\x22Textures are displayed without any filtering. Blocks may look blurry when viewed at an angle.\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering.rgss\x22:\x22RGSS\x22,\x22options.textureFiltering.rgss.tooltip\x22:\x22(Rotated Grid Super Sampling)\x5cnA shader-based filtering method that improves texture quality with a moderate performance impact.\x22,\x22options.title\x22:\x22Options\x22,\x22options.touchscreen\x22:\x22Touchscreen Mode\x22,\x22options.value\x22:\x22%s\x22,\x22options.video\x22:\x22Video Settings...\x22,\x22options.video.display.header\x22:\x22Display\x22,\x22options.video.interface.header\x22:\x22Interface\x22,\x22options.video.preferences.header\x22:\x22Preferences\x22,\x22options.video.quality.header\x22:\x22Quality & Performance\x22,\x22options.videoTitle\x22:\x22Video Settings\x22,\x22options.viewBobbing\x22:\x22View Bobbing\x22,\x22options.vignette\x22:\x22Show Vignette\x22,\x22options.vignette.tooltip\x22:\x22This is a subtle texture over the game screen used for reducing brightness towards the edges of the screen and warning about the world border.\x22,\x22options.visible\x22:\x22Shown\x22,\x22options.vsync\x22:\x22VSync\x22,\x22options.weatherRadius\x22:\x22Weather Effect Radius\x22,\x22options.weatherRadius.tooltip\x22:\x22Radius of the area where rain and snow effects are visible. Very low performance impact.\x22,\x22options.worldOptions.allow_commands.disabled.tooltip\x22:\x22Cannot allow commands in a hardcore world.\x22,\x22options.worldOptions.button\x22