 doing. Please visit %s to learn more.\x22,\x22symlink_warning.message.pack\x22:\x22Loading packs with symbolic links can be unsafe if you don't know exactly what you are doing. Please visit %s to learn more.\x22,\x22symlink_warning.message.world\x22:\x22Loading worlds from folders with symbolic links can be unsafe if you don't know exactly what you are doing. Please visit %s to learn more.\x22,\x22symlink_warning.more_info\x22:\x22More Information\x22,\x22symlink_warning.title\x22:\x22World folder contains symbolic links\x22,\x22symlink_warning.title.pack\x22:\x22Added pack(s) contain(s) symbolic links\x22,\x22symlink_warning.title.world\x22:\x22The world folder contains symbolic links\x22,\x22team.collision.always\x22:\x22Always\x22,\x22team.collision.never\x22:\x22Never\x22,\x22team.collision.pushOtherTeams\x22:\x22Push other teams\x22,\x22team.collision.pushOwnTeam\x22:\x22Push own team\x22,\x22team.notFound\x22:\x22Unknown team '%s'\x22,\x22team.visibility.always\x22:\x22Always\x22,\x22team.visibility.hideForOtherTeams\x22:\x22Hide for other teams\x22,\x22team.visibility.hideForOwnTeam\x22:\x22Hide for own team\x22,\x22team.visibility.never\x22:\x22Never\x22,\x22telemetry_info.button.give_feedback\x22:\x22Give Feedback\x22,\x22telemetry_info.button.privacy_statement\x22:\x22Privacy Statement\x22,\x22telemetry_info.button.show_data\x22:\x22View My Data\x22,\x22telemetry_info.opt_in.description\x22:\x22I consent to sending optional telemetry data\x22,\x22telemetry_info.property_title\x22:\x22Included Data\x22,\x22telemetry_info.screen.description\x22:\x22Collecting this data helps us improve Minecraft by guiding us in directions that are relevant to our players.\x5cnYou can also send in additional feedback to help us keep improving Minecraft.\x22,\x22telemetry_info.screen.title\x22:\x22Telemetry Data Collection\x22,\x22telemetry.event.advancement_made.description\x22:\x22Understanding the context behind receiving an advancement can help us better understand and improve the progression of the game.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.advancement_made.title\x22:\x22Advancement Made\x22,\x22telemetry.event.game_load_times.description\x22:\x22This event can help us figure out where startup performance improvements are needed by measuring the execution times of the startup phases.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.game_load_times.title\x22:\x22Game Load Times\x22,\x22telemetry.event.graphics_capabilities.description\x22:\x22This event informs us of the capabilities of the graphics device used to play the game.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.graphics_capabilities.title\x22:\x22Graphics Capabilities\x22,\x22telemetry.event.optional\x22:\x22%s (Optional)\x22,\x22telemetry.event.optional.disabled\x22:\x22%s (Optional) - Disabled\x22,\x22telemetry.event.p2p_connection.description\x22:\x22This event helps us understand the reliability and performance of peer-to-peer connections between players. It records whether the connection was successful, the type of Interactive Connectivity Establishment (ICE, the protocol we use to establish peer-to-peer connections) candidate used, and how long it took to establish the connection.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.p2p_connection.title\x22:\x22Peer-to-peer Connection\x22,\x22telemetry.event.performance_metrics.description\x22:\x22Knowing the overall performance profile of Minecraft helps us tune and optimize the game for a wide range of machine specifications and operating systems. \x5cnGame version is included to help us compare the performance profile for new versions of Minecraft.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.performance_metrics.title\x22:\x22Performance Metrics\x22,\x22telemetry.event.required\x22:\x22%s (Required)\x22,\x22telemetry.event.world_load_times.description\x22:\x22It's important for us to understand how long it takes to join a world, and how that changes over time. For example, when we add new features or do larger technical changes, we need to see what impact that had on load times.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.world_load_times.title\x22:\x22World Load Times\x22,\x22telemetry.event.world_loaded.description\x22:\x22Knowing how players play Minecraft (such as Game Mode, client or server modded, and game version) allows us to focus game updates to improve the areas that players care about most.\x5cnThe World Loaded event is paired with the World Unloaded event to calculate how long the play session has lasted.\x22,\x22telemetry.event.world_loaded.title\x22:\x22World Loaded\x22,\x22telemetry.event.world_unloaded.description\x22:\x22This event is paired with the World Loaded event to calculate how long the world session has lasted.\x5cnThe duration (in seconds and ticks) is measured when a world session has ended (quitting to title, disconnecting from a server).\x22,\x22telemetry.event.world_unloaded.title\x22:\x22World Unloaded\x22,\x22telemetry.property.advancement_game_time.title\x22:\x22Game Time (Ticks)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.advancement_id.title\x22:\x22Advancement ID\x22,\x22telemetry.property.backend_failure_message.title\x22:\x22Backend Creation Failure Message\x22,\x22telemetry.property.backend_failure_missing_capabilities.title\x22:\x22Backend Creation Failure Missing Capabilities\x22,\x22telemetry.property.backend_failure_reason.title\x22:\x22Backend Creation Failure Reason\x22,\x22telemetry.property.backend_name.title\x22:\x22Backend Name\x22,\x22telemetry.property.client_id.title\x22:\x22Client ID\x22,\x22telemetry.property.client_modded.title\x22:\x22Client Modded\x22,\x22telemetry.property.dedicated_memory_kb.title\x22:\x22Dedicated Memory (kB)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.event_timestamp_utc.title\x22:\x22Event Timestamp (UTC)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.frame_rate_samples.title\x22:\x22Frame Rate Samples (FPS)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.game_mode.title\x22:\x22Game Mode\x22,\x22telemetry.property.game_version.title\x22:\x22Game Version\x22,\x22telemetry.property.launcher_name.title\x22:\x22Launcher Name\x22,\x22telemetry.property.load_time_bootstrap_ms.title\x22:\x22Bootstrap Time (Milliseconds)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.load_time_loading_overlay_ms.title\x22:\x22Time in Loading Screen (Milliseconds)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.load_time_pre_window_ms.title\x22:\x22Time Before Window Opens (Milliseconds)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.load_time_total_time_ms.title\x22:\x22Total Load Time (Milliseconds)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.minecraft_session_id.title\x22:\x22Minecraft Session ID\x22,\x22telemetry.property.new_world.title\x22:\x22New World\x22,\x22telemetry.property.number_of_samples.title\x22:\x22Sample Count\x22,\x22telemetry.property.operating_system.title\x22:\x22Operating System\x22,\x22telemetry.property.opt_in.title\x22:\x22Opt-In\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_failure_stage.title\x22:\x22Failure Stage\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_ice_connect_time_ms.title\x22:\x22Interactive Connectivity Establishment (ICE) Connect Time (Milliseconds)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_ice_path.title\x22:\x22Interactive Connectivity Establishment (ICE) Path\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_local_candidate_type.title\x22:\x22Local Candidate Type\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_remote_candidate_type.title\x22:\x22Remote Candidate Type\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_signaling_time_ms.title\x22:\x22Signaling Connection Time (Milliseconds)\x22,\x22telemetry.property.p2p_connection_successful.title\x22:\x22Connection Successful\x22,\x22teleme"
