n, so you will not be eligible to purchase additional Minecraft Education licenses with this iTunes account.\x0d\x0aauthentication.store.purchase.button=Purchase license (%s/year)\x0d\x0aauthentication.store.terms=Terms of Use\x0d\x0aauthentication.store.viewTermsAndConditions=Terms and Conditions\x0d\x0aauthentication.store.viewPrivacyPolicy=Privacy Policy\x0d\x0aauthentication.toast.refreshFailed.title=Account\x0d\x0aauthentication.toast.refreshFailed.body=There's something wrong with your account info. Please sign in again to continue using multiplayer features.\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.generic.title=Unable to Sign In\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.generic.body=We were unable to sign you in. Please make sure you are signing in with your school or organizational account and try again.\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.generic.link1=Learn more about account eligibility.\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.generic.link2=Try a demo lesson.\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.outOfDate.title=Update Required\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.outOfDate.body=We're sorry, but this version of Minecraft Education is no longer supported. Please update to the latest version to continue playing.\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.outOfDate.downloadPage=Go to Download page\x0d\x0aauthentication.error.accountType.body=Oops! It looks like you signed in with a personal account. This account is not eligible to use Minecraft Education. Please make sure you are signing in with a school or organizational account and try again.\x0d\x0aeula.intro=To use Minecraft Education you must accept the End-User Licensing Agreement.\x0d\x0aeula.location=The EULA is at:\x0d\x0aeula.title=End-User Licensing Agreement\x0d\x0aeula.view=View EULA\x0d\x0aeula.callToAction=Click Accept to accept the terms of this agreement.\x0d\x0aeula.acceptButton=Accept\x0d\x0abook.byAuthor=by\x0d\x0abook.defaultAuthor=Author Unknown\x0d\x0abook.editTitle=Enter Book Title:\x0d\x0abook.export=Export\x0d\x0abook.finalizeButton=Sign and Close\x0d\x0abook.f