ldScreen.experimentalVillagerTradesRebalance=Villager Trade Rebalancing\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.experimentalVillagerTradesRebalanceDescription=Contains updated trades for villagers for the purpose of rebalancing\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.experimentalFurnaceRecipeBook=Furnace Recipe Book\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.experimentalFurnaceRecipeBookDescription=Add a recipe book in the furnace screen, similar to the one in the crafting table\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.experimentalVoxelShapeFeatures=Experimental Voxel Shape Features\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.experimentalVoxelShapeFeaturesDescription=Enables the use of voxel shapes for some vanilla and custom blocks\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.worldPreferences=World Preferences\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.startWithMap=Starting Map\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.startWithMap.name=Starting map\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.startWithMap.description=Spawn with a blank map to explore your world\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.defaultName=My World\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.create=Create\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.createOnRealms=Create on Realms Server\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.delete=Delete\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.deleteWorld=Delete World\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.delete.desc=Delete your world forever.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.delete.confirm=Delete world permanently?\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.deleteWarningFormat=Are you sure you want to delete \x22%s\x22? This world will be lost forever! (A long time!)\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.editTitleFormat=Edit \x22%s\x22\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.game.settings=Game Settings\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.hardcoreActive=Some settings are disabled because you selected hardcore mode when creating this world.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.isHardcore=Hardcore mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.isHardcore.description=You can\xe2\x80\x99t respawn if you die. Good luck! You\xe2\x80\x99ll need it.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode=Game Mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.default=Default Game Mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.default.name=Default game mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.default.description=Select a game mode for players entering your world\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.personal=Personal Game Mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.personal.name=Personal game mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.personal.description=Select your preferred game mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.personal.disabled=Enable cheats to select a preferred game mode\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.adventure=Adventure\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.creative=Creative\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.creative.desc=Unlimited resources. No damage. Flying. No achievements even if you switch to survival later.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.survival=Survival\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.survival.desc=Limited resources, you'll need tools. You may get hurt. Watch out for Monsters.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.spectator=Spectator\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.serverDefault=Default\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.description.adventure=Explore special worlds and play by the rules of their creator.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.description.creative=Create, build, and explore without limits. You can fly, have endless materials, and can\xe2\x80\x99t be hurt by monsters.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.description.survival=Explore a mysterious world where you build, collect, craft, and fight monsters.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.description.spectator=Fly around and observe without interacting with the world or being seen.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.gameMode.description.serverDefault=Whatever the default game mode is\xe2\x80\xa6 that's what you get.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.delete=World Permanence\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.editLocal=Edit your World\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.general.project=Project\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.general.exportSettings=Export Settings\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.general.exportSettings.description=\xc2\xa77Some functionality may be overridden during Editing session, but are fully respected when exported\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.local=Create a World\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.realms=Create a Realms Server\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.header.realmsReset=Reset your Realm?\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.levelName=Name\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.levelSeed=Seed\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.levelSeed.description=A mysterious series of numbers used to create your world\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.levelSeed.copy=Copy seed\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.levelSeed.notification=Copied to clipboard\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.multiplayer.settings=Multiplayer Settings\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.progress.local=Creating new world...\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.progress.realms=Resetting Realm...\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.seed.desc=Enter a seed to generate the same terrain again. Leave blank for a random world.\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.showCoordinates=Show Coordinates\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.showCoordinates.name=Show coordinates\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.showCoordinates.description=Display your current position at all times\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.showDaysPlayed=Show Days Played\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.showDaysPlayed.name=Show days played\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.showDaysPlayed.description=Number of in-game days that have passed\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.worldType=World Type\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.randomtickspeed=Random Tick Speed\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.randomtickspeed.name=Tick Speed\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.randomtickspeed.description=Changes the speed of the world and everything in it (max 4096)\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.randomtickspeed.reset=Reset Random Tick Speed\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.serverSimDistance=Simulation Distance\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.serverSimDistance.description=The game loads and applies changes within a range of %1$sx%1$s blocks from the player\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.serverSimDistanceFormat=%s chunks\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.playerSleepPercentage=Players needed to skip night\x0d\x0acreateWorldScreen.play