rrent Link?\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.refreshDialogLabel=This will disable the current link and generate a new one. Anyone who became a member already will still be able to join your Realm.\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.createLinkDialogTitle=Generate Realm Link?\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.createLinkDialogLabel=Anyone who opens this link will become a member of your Realm. You can disable a link by generating a new one.\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.shareDialogTitle=Download Backup Before Sharing?\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.shareDialogLabel=Anyone with this link can become a member of your Realm. Be careful who you share it with. You may want to download a backup of your world first. You can remove members from Realm settings.\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.shareDialogShareButton=Share\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.shareDialogCopyButton=Copy\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.closedRealmWarning=Your Realm is closed. Members cannot join.\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.generate=Generate\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.disable=Disable\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.backup=Download\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.kick=Remove\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.kickAndBlock=Block\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.kickPopupTitle=Revoke Access?\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.kickPopupText=Do you want to revoke access for this player? You can undo this at any time.\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.copyToastMessage=Link to your Realm copied to clipboard!\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.playerFilterTitle=Filter players\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.setPermissionFail=Failed to set permission for user %s.\x0d\x0arealmsInvitationScreen.setDefaultPermissionFail=Failed to set default permissions.\x0d\x0arealmJoining.progressTitle=Joining Realm...\x0d\x0arealmsClearMembers.clearMembersTitle=Clear Members?\x0d\x0arealmsClearMembers.clearMembersText=Do you want to clear the members list of this Realm?\x0d\x0arealmsClearMembers.clear=Clear Members\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.join=Join\x0d\x0arealmsSharin