  result.add "nClosedMessage=%s is closed. Ask %s to reopen it.\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.failedSignInModalTitle=Sign in to join this Realm\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.failedSignInModalMessage=You need to be signed in to a Microsoft account to join a Realm. Please sign in and try again.\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.invalidPermissionTitle=Invalid permissions\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.unexpectedServerResponseTitle=Realms Error\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.unexpectedServerResponseMessage=Sorry, we had a problem connecting to the Realm. Please try again later.\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.inviteLinkNotFoundTitle=Realms Error\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.inviteLinkNotFoundMessage=The link is invalid.\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.inviteLinkDisabledMessage=The link is disabled.\x0d\x0arealmsSharingScreen.inviteLinkExpiredMessage=The link is expired.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.title.create=Create a Realm Server\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.title.extend=Extend Your Realm\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.title.renew=Renew Your Realm\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.defaultRealm=%s's Realm\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.creatingRealm=Creating Realm...\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.nameHeader.name=Realm Name\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.nameHeader.rename=Rename Realm?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.termsAndConditionsAgree=I agree\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.termsAndConditionsHeader=Terms and Conditions\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.viewTermsAndConditions=View Terms and Conditions\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.viewPrivacyPolicy=View Privacy Policy\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.durationHeader=Duration\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.durationShort=30 Days\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.durationLong=180 Days\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.sizeHeader=Tier\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchasePrefix.create=Create\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchasePrefix.extend=Extend\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchasePrefix.renew=Renew\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.subscription.trial=Create For Free!%s(%s/month after first 30 days)\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.subscription.trial.30days=Create For Free!%s(%s/30 days after first 30 days)\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.subscription.buy=Create for %s per month\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.subscription.renew=Renew for %s per month\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.consumable.trial=Create for Free!\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.consumable.buy=Create for %s\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.consumable.renew=Renew for %s\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.consumable.extend=Extend for %s\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.errorRealmName=Your Realm name cannot be blank.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.errorRealmNameAndTOS=Your Realm name cannot be blank, and you must accept the terms of service to create a Realm.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.errorTOS=Must accept terms and conditions to create a Realm.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.goBack=Go Back\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.contactSupport=Contact Support\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.createFailed.title=Something Went Wrong\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseFailed=Sorry, we were unable to complete your Realm purchase. Maybe check your internet connection?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.createFailed.content=Your purchase succeeded, but we couldn't create your Realm right now. We will create your Realm as soon as possible. Check back later on this device. If this problem happens for more than a day, please contact Mojang Support.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.createFailed.profanity=The Realm name %s is not allowed.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.createFailed.generic=Club name could not be verified. Please try again later.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.descriptionFailed.profanity=The Realm description you selected contains words that others may find offensive and cannot be used. Please change the Realm description and try again.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.renameFailed.profanity=The world name %s is not allowed.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.maxRealms.title=Maximum Subscriptions\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.maxRealms.content=You have the maximum number of active subscriptions on this platform and cannot create a new one right now.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.offerNotFound.title=Store Connection Lost\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.offerNotFound.content=Your device lost connection to the store and we can't confirm this offer is still available. Please check your internet connection or try again later.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.offerNotAvailable.title=Store Connection Lost\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.offerNotAvailable.content=Your device lost connection to the store and we can't confirm this offer is still available. Please check your internet connection or try again later.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.extendRealms.content=You have extended your Realms subscription as long as possible. You cannot add this additional time right now. Try again later.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.twoUsers=2 Players\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.tenUsers=10 Players\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.viewTOS=To view the terms and conditions for Minecraft Realms, please visit https://www.minecraft.net/eula in any web browser.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.viewPrivacyPolicyText=To view the privacy policy for Minecraft Realms, please visit https://aka.ms/mcprivacy in any web browser.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.waitingPurchase=Purchase in progress! This shouldn't take long.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.paymentFailed.title=Payment service\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.paymentFailed.body=Unable to connect to Realms and complete your purchase at this time. Please try again later.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete=Incomplete Realm\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.create.a=It looks like we didn't finish things last time. Let's complete creating your Realm now.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.create.b=It looks like you started creating a Realm with a different Microsoft account. Do you want to complete creating that Realm with this Microsoft account as the owner?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.create.c=Someone started creating a Realm with the billing account on this device. Would you like to complete creating that Realm with this Microsoft account as the owner?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.renew.a=It looks like we didn't finish things last time. Let's complete renewing your Realm now.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.renew.b=It looks like you started renewing a Realm with a different\xc2\xa0Microsoft account. \xc2\xa0Do you want to complete renewing that Realm with this Microsoft account as the owner?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.renew.c=Someone started renewing a Realm with the billing account on this device. \xc2\xa0Would you like to complete renewing that Realm with this Microsoft account as the owner?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.override.renew=You are attempting to create a new Realm but a prior purchase was found for renewing a Realm. Would you like to apply that purchase now?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.override.create=You are attempting to renew a Realm but a prior purchase was found for creating a Realm. Would you like to apply that purchase now?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.incomplete.override.realm=You are attempting to renew a Realm but a prior purchase was found for a different Realm. Would you like to apply that purchase now?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.prepare.store.title=Purchase History Needed\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.prepare.store.body=We need you to sign in to the store to view your purchase history before we can continue.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.prepare.store.button=Sign In to Store\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.playNowTitle=Play on Realm, Now?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.playNowMessage1=You can invite friends to your Realm and start playing now.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.playNowMessage2=Otherwise, you can find it anytime in the Worlds tab of the Play screen. Edit it to change game modes or even upload any world to your Realm.\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.playWithFriends=Play with Friends\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.playSolo=Play Solo\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseConfirmation.title=Purchase Realm?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseConfirmation.create.message=Are you sure you want to create a Realm?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseConfirmation.extend.message=Are you sure you want to extend a Realm?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseConfirmation.renew.message=Are you sure you want to renew a Realm?\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseConfirmation.continue=Confirm Purchase\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.purchaseConfirmation.cancel=Cancel\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.title=Create a Realm\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.nameHeader=Realm Name\x0d\x0arealmsCreateScreen.chooseWorld=Create Realm: Choose World\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.realmName=Realm Name\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.realmDescription=Realm Description\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.open=Open Realm\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.close=Close Realm\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.resetR"
  result.add "ealm=Resetting a Realm permanently erases the world and starts over. Are you sure you want to do this?\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.confirmReset=Confirm Reset\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.resetRealmTryAgain=Failed to reset the Realm. Would you like to try again?\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.failedOpenCloseTitle=Failed open/close.\x0d\x0arealmsConfigurationScreen.failedOpenClose=Failed to open/close the Realm. Would you like to try again?\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.notAvailable=Your device does not support Minecraft Realms.\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.ownerPay=The owner pays monthly. Their friends can join for free!\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.realmsDescription=Realms are private Minecraft worlds that are always available for you and your friends.\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.realmsDescription.paragraph2=You can play on them even when the owner of the Realm is away and from any device running Minecraft!\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.realmsDescription.paragraph3=Explore your Realm today!\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.realmsDescription.Beta.line1=Realms, the safe, simple way to share a Minecraft world with friends, is not available while using beta versions of Minecraft.\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.realmsDescription.Beta.line2=If you'd like to stop using the beta and access Realms, click below for instructions.\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.newRealm=New Realm\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.connectLive=Sign In to Try for Free!\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.owner=owner\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.leaveBeta=Leave the Beta?\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.newRealmTrial=Start Your Free 30 Day Trial%s(%s/mo after the first month)\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.newRealmTrial.30days=Start Your Free 30 Day Trial%s(%s/30 days after the first 30 days)\x0d\x0arealmsWorld.creatingWorld=Creating World\x0d\x0arealmsPlus.popup.top_button_text=More Info\x0d\x0arealmsPlus.popup.bottom_button_text=Renew Subscription\x0d\x0arealmsPlus.popup.title=Realms Plus Subscription Expired\x0d\x0arealmsPlus.popup.message=Your Realms Plus subscription has expired. To regain access to your Realm and the packs or skins you received from Realms Plus you need to renew your subscription.\x0d\x0acsbCreateScreen.popupTitle=Marketplace Pass\x0d\x0acsbCreateScreen.viewTOS=To view the terms and conditions for Marketplace Pass, please visit https://aka.ms/MinecraftEULA in any web browser.\x0d\x0acsbCreateScreen.viewPrivacyPolicyText=To view the privacy policy for Marketplace Pass, please visit https://aka.ms/mcprivacy in any web browser.\x0d\x0acsbCreateScreen.goBack=Go back\x0d\x0acsbCreateScreen.termsAndConditionsAgree=I agree\x0d\x0acsbCreateScreen.termsAndConditionsHeader=Terms and Conditions\x0d\x0araytracing.RTX.name=RTX\x0d\x0anetwork.onlinePlay.title=Play with Friends\x0d\x0anetwork.onlinePlay.msg=You can invite friends to your worlds, view your friends' creations, and craft in each other's worlds.\x0d\x0anetwork.onlinePlay.instruction=From the Play menu, you can join your friends' worlds or invite them to your worlds and Realms.\x0d\x0anetwork.thirdparty.connect.splitscreen=To play split-screen multiplayer online, sign in to a %s account.\x0d\x0anetwork.thirdparty.connect.benefit=Sign in with your %s to play online with friends and check out cool stuff in the store.\x0d\x0anetwork.thirdparty.connect.store=You will need a %s to browse the store.\x0d\x0anetwork.thirdparty.connect.achievements=You will need a %s to earn achievements.\x0d\x0anetwork.thirdparty.findfriends.failed=We were unable to connect to Microsoft account services. Maybe check your internet connection?\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.add_friend=Add Friend\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.add_server=Add Server\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.add_label=Add\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.join_server=Join Server\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.screenshots=Screenshots:\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.description=Description:\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.available_games=Available Games:\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.news=News:\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.online=Online:\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.current_ping=Current Ping:\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.lan_label=LAN Games\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.servers_label=Servers\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.friends_label=Friends\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.joinable_friends_label=Joinable Friends\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.no_joinable_friends_label=Your friends are not playing Minecraft right now.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.check_internet_connection=Oops! Maybe check your internet connection? We can't find your friends' worlds.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.connect_to_xbl=Sign in with a Microsoft account to play with friends.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.memberOfTooManyRealms=You have reached the Realms membership limit.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.multiplayerPrivilegesBlocked=You cannot play online multiplayer because of how your Microsoft account is set up. Please ensure your online safety settings allow Multiplayer. See instructions for changing these settings at aka.ms/MCMultiplayerHelp.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.multiplayerPrivilegesBlockedOnConsole=You cannot play online multiplayer because of how your Microsoft account is set up. Please ensure you have an active Xbox Live Gold subscription and your online safety settings allow Multiplayer. See instructions for changing these settings at aka.ms/MCMultiplayerHelp.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.multiplayerPrivilegesBlockedOnConsoleGamecore=You cannot play online multiplayer because of how your Microsoft account is set up.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.multiplayerPrivilegesUnknown=An unknown error occured which is preventing online play. Please try again later.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.multiplayerPrivilegesBlockedBanned=You cannot play online multiplayer because your account is suspended.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.versionOutOfDate=You cannot play online multiplayer because you are not running the latest version. Please install the latest version to access online features.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.lost_connection.hosting_stopped=There was a problem and multiplayer hosting has stopped.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.lost_connection.needs_restart=There was a problem with your connection. Multiplayer hosting has stopped and will need to be restarted.\x0d\x0anetworkWorld.more_servers=More Servers\x0d\x0anetworkWo