 on different platforms. Sign in to your Microsoft account to play with all your Minecraft friends!\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.carousel.realms=Realms are servers run by us, just for you and your friends. Keep your Minecraft world online and always accessible, even when you log-off.\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.carousel.villager=New Minecraft is the only place to receive future updates containing new features, mobs, items, blocks and much more!\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.tab.landing=What's New\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.tab.marketplace=Marketplace\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.tab.crossplatform=Cross-platform Play\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.tab.realms=Realms\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.tab.villager=More Content\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.finish=Finish\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.next=Next\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.no_internet=Connect to the internet to load your previous skin.\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.intro_title=Minecraft has Updated!\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.intro_body_1=There's a lot of great new content in this update.\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.intro_body_2=Would you like help importing your saves, settings, and content from the previous version of Minecraft?\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.intro_welcome_1=You've updated to the latest version of Minecraft!\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.intro_welcome_2=If you would like to return to the previous version of Minecraft, you can find it on the main menu\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.editions_launch_warning=This is not the latest version of Minecraft, are you sure you want to launch the previous version of Minecraft?\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.editions_title=Launch Previous Version?\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.settings_imported=We've imported your settings for you!\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.settings_skin_imported=We've imported your skin and settings for you!\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.skin_current=Current Skin\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.skin_default=Default Skin\x0d\x0adayOneExperience.skin_tip=You can change your skin by selecting the Profile button on the main menu.\x0d\x0adayOneExperience