onnectionScreen.internalError.cantFindEdit=We were unable to connect you. Try adding a new server.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.internalError.cantFindLocal=There was a problem loading this world.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.internalError.cantFindRealm=There was a problem finding this Realm.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.internalError.cantFindServer=There was a problem finding this server.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.invalidName=Invalid name!\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.invalidPlayer=This world's multiplayer setting is set to friends only. You must be friends with the host of this world to join.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.invalidIP=Invalid IP address!\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.invalidSkin=Invalid or corrupt skin!\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.lockedSkin.title=Platform Restricted Skin!\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.lockedSkin=The Skin that you have equipped is from a content pack that is not allowed in cross-platform multiplayer games.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.multiplayerLockedSkin.title=Multiplayer Restricted Skin!\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.multiplayerLockedSkin=The Skin that you have equipped is from a content pack that is not allowed in multiplayer games.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.loggedinOtherLocation=Logged in from other location\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.multiplayerDisabled=The world has been set to single player mode.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.noReason=You have been disconnected\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.noInternet=Please check your connection to the internet and try again.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.notAllowed=You're not invited to play on this server.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.notAuthenticated=You need to authenticate to Microsoft services.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedClient=Could not connect: Outdated client!\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedServer=The host is using an older version of Minecraft. Everyone should update to the latest version of Minecraft and try again.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedClientRealms=You need to update your game to continue playing on this Realm.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedClientRealms.title=Realms Has Updated\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedServerRealms=Your game is up-to-date but this Realm is not.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedServerRealms.title=We can't update your Realm server right now because other players are currently online. You can close and reopen your Realm from the Manage Realm screen to make the other players quit and then join your Realm to update it.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.outdatedServerRealmsNonOwner.title=The Realm you are attempting to access is a different version. Contact the owner of the Realm to address the issue.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.realmsServerUpdateIncoming=Your Realm will soon be updated. You will need an update too.\x0d\x0adisconnectionScreen.realmsServerUpdateIncoming.title=Check "
