ates.create_new=CREATE NEW\x0d\x0aedu.templates.delete=DELETE\x0d\x0aedu.templates.delete_title=Delete this world template?\x0d\x0aedu.templates.delete_body=Are you sure you want to delete the \x22%s\x22 world template? This won't affect any worlds you created from this template.\x0d\x0aedu.templates.delete_confirm=Delete\x0d\x0aedu.templates.info_banner=World templates are blueprints. You can use them to create new worlds that always start out the same.\x0d\x0aedu.templates.empty_banner=You can get world templates from the Minecraft Education Library, other Minecraft Education users, or education.minecraft.net\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.title=Servers\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.search_placeholder=Search Servers\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.add_info_placeholder=Please enter the Server ID\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.add_server=Add Server\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.confirm_add_server=Add\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.play=PLAY\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.back=BACK\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.share=SHARE\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.remove=REMOVE\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.new=NEW\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.confirm_remove.title=Remove\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.confirm_remove.body=If you remove this server you can still add it again later.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.confirm_remove.confirm=Remove server\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.server_id_label=Server ID\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.server_id_info=Enter the Server ID you would like to add.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.server_id_tooltip_text=The Server ID is the unique identification of the server that you are trying to add.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.server_id_tooltip_tts=The Server I D is the unique identification of the server that you are trying to add.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.disabled.title=Disabled Server\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.disabled.body=This server is disabled, so you can't join it.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.world.unavailable=Unavailable\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.world.disabled=Disabled\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.enter_passcode_title=Enter Passcode\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.passcode_info=This server requires a passcode. If you don't know the passcode, ask for help.\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.passcode_info_placeholder=Please enter the server passcode\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.passcode_tooltip_label=Passcode\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.passcode_tooltip_text=The passcode may contain only letters or numbers.\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.passcode_tooltip_tts=The passcode may contain only letters or numbers.\x0d\x0aedu.passcode_entry_screen.hide_passcode=Hide Passcode\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.generic_error_expired_title=Session expired\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.generic_error_expired_body=We can't fetch your servers right now. Please try again later. If the problem persists, try restarting the app, or signing out and signing in again.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.generic_error_unavailable_title=Service unavailable\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.generic_error_unavailable_body=We're unable to connect to the service. Please check your internet connection and try again. If the problem persists, contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_add_server_forbidden_title=Insufficient permissions\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_add_server_forbidden_body=You don't have access to the server ID you entered. Try double checking that you entered the correct server ID or contacting your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_add_server_not_found_title=Server not found\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_add_server_not_found_body=The server you tried to add could not be found. It may not exist or may have been removed. Try double checking that you entered the correct server ID or contacting your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_add_server_unknown_error_title=Add server error\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_add_server_unknown_error_body=Oops! Something went wrong while adding the server. Please try again. If the problem persists, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_load_server_feature_disabled_title=Dedicated servers disabled\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_load_server_feature_disabled_body=Your Minecraft Education servers have been disabled. For more information, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_load_server_unknown_error_title=Fetch servers error\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_load_server_unknown_error_body=Oops! Something went wrong while fetching your servers. Please try again. If the problem persists, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_incorrect_passcode_title=Incorrect passcode\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_incorrect_passcode_body=The passcode you entered is incorrect. Please try again.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_feature_disabled_title=Dedicated servers disabled\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_feature_disabled_body=Your Minecraft Education servers have been disabled. For more information, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_unexpectedly_disabled_title=Server disabled\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_unexpectedly_disabled_body=This Minecraft Education server has been disabled. For more information, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_removed_title=Server removed\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_removed_body=This Minecraft Education server has been permanently removed. For more information, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_unavailable_title=Server unavailable\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_unavailable_body=The server became unavailable while attempting to join. For more information, please contact your IT administrator.\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_unknown_error_title=Join server error\x0d\x0aedu.servers_screen.error_join_server_unknown_error_body=Oops! Something w