t.description=A single-player feature that pauses gameplay while the game menu is open\x0d\x0aoptions.pauseMenuOnFocusLost=Show Pause Menu on Focus Lost\x0d\x0aoptions.pauseMenuOnFocusLost.description=Shows the pause menu when switching to another application\x0d\x0aoptions.tutorial_show_animation=Show animations in tutorial tips\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateEnabled=Auto Update Unlocked Packs\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateEnabled.description=Newly released versions of your packs will be downloaded as soon as they\xe2\x80\x99re available\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateEnabled.name=Automatically update content packs\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateMode=Auto Update Unlocked Packs\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateMode.off=Off\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateMode.on.withWifiOnly=On with Wi-Fi Only\x0d\x0aoptions.autoUpdateMode.on.withCellular=On with Wi-Fi or Mobile Data\x0d\x0aoptions.allowCellularData=Allow mobile data for online play\x0d\x0aoptions.allowCellularData.description=Use Mobile data for Multiplayer when Wi-Fi is unavailable. This might incur additional data costs\x0d\x0aoptions.allowCellularData.message=Use mobile data for multiplayer when Wi-Fi is unavailable. This might incur additional data costs.\x0d\x0aoptions.cellularDataWarningLabel=Playing over mobile networks may incur additional charges with your carrier.\x0d\x0aoptions.openFeedbackPage=Get Support\x0d\x0aoptions.openFeedbackPage.message=Access technical support, customer resources, and community forums at the Minecraft Education Support Center.\x0d\x0aoptions.openFeedbackPage.continue=Go to Support Center\x0d\x0aoptions.openFeedbackPage.close=Close\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOffAchievements=Turn off achievements?\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOffAchievements.message=Achievements are only available in worlds set to survival mode with cheats off. If you continue, no one will earn achievements while playing in this world ever again even if you switch back before playing.\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOnHardcoreMode=Turn on Hardcore mode?\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOnHardcoreMode.message=Here\xe2\x80\x99s what you need to know about Hardcore mode:\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOnHardcoreMode.message.1=1. When you die, you will not respawn \xe2\x80\x94 game over!\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOnHardcoreMode.message.2=2. Hardcore mode can\xe2\x80\x99t be turned off after the world is created.\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOnHardcoreMode.message.3=3. After you die, you can see but not interact with this world.\x0d\x0aoptions.achievementsDisabled=Achievements cannot be earned in this world.\x0d\x0aoptions.achievementsDisabled.onLoad=If you start playing with these settings, achievements will no longer be earnable in this world.\x0d\x0aoptions.achievementsDisabled.notSignedIn=Achievements can be earned in this world, but you must sign in to a Microsoft account to earn them.\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOffCrossPlatformMultiplayer=Turn Off Cross-Platform Multiplayer?\x0d\x0aoptions.turnOffCrossPlatformMultiplayer.message=The content that you are trying to use is not allowed in cross-platform multiplayer games. If you continue you will not be able to play cross-platform multiplayer games.\x0d\x0aoptions.conflictingPacks=Conflicting Packs\x0d\x0aoptions.conflictingPacks.message.onStack=A pack already on the stack can't be applied with other packs. %s\x0d\x0aoptions.conflictingPacks.message.offStack=The pack you are trying to apply can't be applied with other packs. %s\x0d\x0aoptions.conflictingPacks.message.offStackWithBehavior=Continuing will remove all current packs and then add the pack you are trying to apply. This will remove all behavior packs from the world which can break the world and cause you to lose what you created.\x0d\x0aoptions.conflictingPacks.continue=Continuing will remove all current packs and then add the pack you are trying to apply.\x0d\x0aoptions.crossPlatformMultiplayerDisabled=Content active in this world cannot be used in cross-platform multiplayer.\x0d\x0aoptions.multiplayerDisabled=Content active in this world cannot be used in multiplayer.\x0d\x0aoptions.skinsCrossPlatformMultiplayerDisabled=The skin you're using cannot be used in cross-platform multiplayer.\x0d\x0aoptions.skinsMultiplayerDisabled=The skin you're using cannot be used in multiplayer.\x0d\x0aoptions.content.noRealms=Edit World?\x0d\x0aoptions.content.noRealms.message=This world uses a resource pack or template that cannot be used in cross-platform multiplayer.\x0d\x0aoptions.experimentalWorldLoad=Load Experimental World?\x0d\x0aoptions.experimentalWorldLoad.message=This world uses features that are still under development. It might crash, break, or stop working at any time.\x0d\x0aoptions.updateWorldHeight=World update\x0d\x0aoptions.updateWorldHeight.message=This update makes your world higher and deeper. It adds more blocks and caves under your current world, so there's more to explore underground.\x0d\x0aoptions.activateExperimentalGameplay.message=Be careful! You're abou"
  result.add "t to create a copy of your world with Experiments turned on. This new world might crash, break, or not work with future updates.\x0d\x0aoptions.activateExperimentalGameplay=Activate Experimental Gameplay?\x0d\x0aoptions.activateExperimentalGameplay.activate=Activate Experiments\x0d\x0aoptions.activateExperimentalGameplayCreate.message=Be careful! You're activating features that are still under development. Your world might crash, break, or not work with future updates.\x0d\x0aoptions.activateFancyBubbles=Activate Fancy Bubble Columns?\x0d\x0aoptions.activateFancyBubblesCreate.message=Enables Fancy Bubble Columns. Fancy Bubble Columns may lower performance on some devices.\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions=Discard the Creator's Settings?\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.message=The experience that the creator of this template wants you to have might be broken if you unlock these settings. You might not be able to return to that intended experience if you continue.\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.initiate=Unlock Template World Options\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.ok=Unlock All Settings\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.cancel=Keep Creator Settings\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.warning=Template World Options are locked to the values set by this template's Creator. Unlock to change them.\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.packWarning=Unlock Template World Options from Game Settings to change the packs for this world.\x0d\x0aoptions.unlockTemplateWorldOptions.permissionsWarning=Unlock Template World Options from Game Settings to be able to change permissions.\x0d\x0aoptions.lockedTemplateOptions=Discard the creator's settings?\x0d\x0aoptions.lockedTemplateOptions.message=The experience that the creator of this template wants you to have might be broken if you unlock these settings. You might not be able to return to that intended experience if you continue.\x0d\x0aoptions.lockedTemplateOptio