n two packs will be overridden by the higher pack.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.description.default.level=You can edit these in Settings.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.description.default.behaviorPacks=The default gameplay of Minecraft.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.description.bottom.global=Resource packs are applied bottom to top. This means any asset that is in two packs will be overridden by the higher pack. Packs in your worlds will apply on top of these global packs. These resources are just for you. No one else will see the resources you set here. Resource Packs in your worlds or worlds you join will apply on top of these global resources.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.description.bottom.behaviorPacks=Behavior Packs are applied bottom to top. That means anything that is in two Behavior"
  result.add " Packs will be overridden by the higher one.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.description.bottom.level=Resource packs are applied bottom to top. This means any asset that is in two packs will be overridden by the higher pack. These packs in your world apply on top of your global pack(s).\x0d\x0aresourcePack.description.store=View in Store\x0d\x0aresourcePack.header.behavior=Active Behavior Packs apply to all players.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.header.level=Require players to download optional resource packs to join\x0d\x0aresourcePack.crashRecovery.title=Global Resources Reset\x0d\x0aresourcePack.crashRecovery.message=Resources failed to load previously.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warnings=Warnings:\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.add.title=Update World?\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.add.body=This world may not look or behave in the same way as non-modified worlds. You should save a copy of your world before continuing.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.add.button.cancel=Don't add pack\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.add.button.ok=Add the pack anyway\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warnings.contentKeyErrorBody=There was a problem loading pack %s. Restarting your game or redownloading the pack might solve the issue.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warnings.contentKeyErrorBodyMultiple=There was a problem loading packs %s. Restarting your game or redownloading the packs might solve the issue.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warnings.contentKeyErrorTitle=Error!\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.multiple.addon=Stacking multiple Add-Ons\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.multiple.addon.link=Link\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.multiple.addon.confirm=Got it!\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.multiple.addon.message=Stacking multiple Add-Ons may result in unpredictable experiences. World loading times could vary, and Add-Ons might behave unexpectedly.\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.multiple.addon.title=Using Add-Ons\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.remove.title=Wait!\x0d\x0aresourcePack.warning.remove.body=Removing packs from previously played worlds may result in perm