herite Ingot\x0d\x0acontainer.smithing_table.template_slot_tooltip=Add Smithing Template\x0d\x0aentity.camel.name=Camel\x0d\x0aentity.chest_raft.name=Raft with Chest\x0d\x0afeature.trail_ruins=Trail Ruins\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.header.1=Smithing Templates\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.header.2=Armor Trims\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.1=Want to get the most out of your equipment? You'll need a Smithing Table.\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.2=Use it to make all kinds of changes, for example by upgrading Diamond equipment to Netherite, or by making cosmetic changes with Armor Trims.\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.3=In order to upgrade your equipment, you'll need a Smithing Template. You can find a large variety throughout the world, which can be used for all kinds of upgrades.\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.4=Place a Template into the leftmost slot of a Smithing Table to see which items you need for the upgrade.\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.5=For example, to upgrade Diamond equipment to Netherite, you need a Netherite Upgrade Smithing Template, which you can find in Bastion Remnants. Then, place the Diamond equipment in the equipment slot and a Netherite ingot in the ingredient slot, and you're done!\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.6=Item properties such as enchantments and armor trims will be retained, but the Smithing Template will be consumed when you upgrade your equipment. Don't worry - you can craft copies of them with your Crafting Table.\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.7=Get creative and customize the look of your armor with Armor Trims. You'll need an Armor Trim Smithing Template to get started, which you can find throughout the world.\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.8=Place a Template into the leftmost slot of a Smithing Table to see which items you need for the upgrade. Then place a piece of armor in the equipment slot and a crystal or ingot in the ingredient slot. Done!\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.text.9=Only certain crystals and ingots can be used for Armor Trims. Try different kinds like Iron, Gold, or Lapis to create unique designs!\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table.title=Smithing Table\x0d\x0ahowtoplay.smithing_table=Smithing Table\x0d\x0ahudScreen.tooltip.brush=Brush\x0d\x0ahudScreen.tooltip.charge=Charge\x0d\x0ahudScreen.tooltip.jab=Jab\x0d\x0aitem.acacia_hanging_sign.name=Acacia Hanging Sign\x0d\x0aitem.angler_pottery_sherd.name=Angler Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.archer_pottery_sherd.name=Archer Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.armor.upgrade=Upgrade:\x0d\x0aitem.arms_up_pottery_sherd.name=Arms Up Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.bamboo_door.name=Bamboo Door\x0d\x0aitem.bamboo_hanging_sign.name=Bamboo Hanging Sign\x0d\x0aitem.bamboo_sign.name=Bamboo Sign\x0d\x0aitem.birch_hanging_sign.name=Birch Hanging Sign\x0d\x0aitem.blade_pottery_sherd.name=Blade Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.boat.bamboo.name=Bamboo Raft\x0d\x0aitem.boat.cherry.name=Cherry Boat\x0d\x0aitem.brewer_pottery_sherd.name=Brewer Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.brush.name=Brush\x0d\x0aitem.burn_pottery_sherd.name=Burn Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.cherry_door.name=Cherry Door\x0d\x0aitem.cherry_hanging_sign.name=Cherry Hanging Sign\x0d\x0aitem.cherry_sign.name=Cherry Sign\x0d\x0aitem.chest_boat.bamboo.name=Bamboo Raft with Chest\x0d\x0aitem.chest_boat.cherry.name=Cherry Boat with Chest\x0d\x0aitem.crimson_hanging_sign.name=Crimson Hanging Sign\x0d\x0aitem.danger_pottery_sherd.name=Danger Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.dark_oak_hanging_sign.name=Dark Oak Hanging Sign\x0d\x0aitem.explorer_pottery_sherd.name=Explorer Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.flow_pottery_sherd.name=Flow Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.friend_pottery_sherd.name=Friend Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.guster_pottery_sherd.name=Guster Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.heart_pottery_sherd.name=Heart Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.heartbreak_pottery_sherd.name=Heartbreak Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.howl_pottery_sherd.name=Howl Pottery Sherd\x0d\x0aitem.jungle_hanging_sign.name=Jungle Hangin