S\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.buyNow.viewPrivacyPolicy=PRIVACY POLICY\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.buyNow.title=Start your Realms Plus Subscription\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.realmName.placeholder=%s's Realm\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.recurring.offerTrial.contentSub=Realms Plus is an ongoing subscription with a recurring subscription fee which is charged automatically every month until the subscription is cancelled.%sYour Realm and catalog of premium content included in Marketplace Pass will be immediately available. Up to 10 players can play at one time, and they get access to the worlds in your Realm for free! Your first 30 days will be free, and you'll be billed %s/month afterwards. You can cancel your subscription to stop future charges by accessing subscriptions settings.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.recurring.offerTrial.contentSub.30days=Realms Plus is an ongoing subscription with a recurring subscription fee which is charged automatically every 30 days until the subscription is cancelled.%sYour Realm and catalog of premium content included in Marketplace Pass will be immediately available. Up to 10 players can play at one time, and they get access to the worlds in your Realm for free! Your first 30 days will be free, and you'll be billed %s/30 days afterwards. You can cancel your subscription to stop future charges by accessing subscriptions settings.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.recurring.withoutTrial.contentSub=Realms Plus is an ongoing subscription with a recurring subscription fee which is charged automatically every month until the subscription is cancelled.%sYour Realm and catalog of premium content included in Marketplace Pass will be immediately available. Up to 10 players can play at one time, and they get access to the worlds in your Realm for free! You'll be billed %s/month and you can cancel your subscription to stop future charges by accessing subscriptions settings.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.recurring.withoutTrial.contentSub.30days=Realms Plus is an ongoing subscription with a recurring subscription fee which is charged automatically every 30 days until the subscription is cancelled.%sYour Realm and catalog of premium content included in Marketplace Pass will be immediately available. Up to 10 players can play at one time, and they get access to the worlds in your Realm for free! You'll be billed %s/30 days and you can cancel your subscription to stop future charges by accessing subscriptions settings.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.consumable.offerTrial.contentSub=Your Realm and catalog of premium content included in Marketplace Pass will be immediately available. Up to 10 players can play at one time, and they get access to the worlds in your Realm for free! Your first 30 days will be free and you can renew for 30 days at the price of %s afterwards.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.consumable.withoutTrial.contentSub=Your Realm and catalog of premium content included in Marketplace Pass will be immediately available. Up to 10 players can play at one time, and they get access to the worlds in your Realm for free! Your subscription will be available for 30 days at the price of %s.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.header=Subscription Includes:\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.headerTrial=Free 30 Day Trial, then %s/month\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.headerTrial.30days=Free 30 Day Trial, then %s/30 days\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info1.line1=Your own personal Realm server: a persistent world always online for you and your friends!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info1.line2=Friends play on your Realm for free\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info1.line3=Jump from console to mobile to PC - play your Realm on any device with the Minecraft Marketplace\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.contentSub=Includes Marketplace Pass\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.backups=Worlds on your Realm include free secure backups\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.renews=Subscription renews automatically each month until canceled\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.cancel=Cancel on the Subscriptions page of Minecraft Settings\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.subscribe=Subscribe now for %s/month\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.subscribe.30days=Subscribe now for %s/30 days\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.recentlyAdded=Recently added\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.persona=Free Character Creator items - redeem a new set each month!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info2.social=Get social with Realms Stories\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.beta=Beta\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.preview=Preview\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info3.para1=Realms are available in Minecraft %s for all Realms subscribers for free! This is a new Realm that gives you the chance to try new features before their release.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info3.para2=With a Realm subscription, you can create a new %s Realm using the \xe2\x80\x9cCreate New\xe2\x80\x9d button in the main menu. If you don\xe2\x80\x99t have a Realms subscription yet, please go to the full version of Minecraft to sign up.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info3.para3=All Realms screens and functions are available in %s except purchasing a new subscription or managing the subscriptions of existing Realms.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.landing.info3.para4=Your %s Realm will remain active for as long as you have the paid Realm subscription that your %s Realm is linked to.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.header=FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question1=What is Realms Plus?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer1=Realms Plus is a subscription to a personal server supporting up to 10 simultaneous players, along with unlimited access to a catalog of premium add-ons, worlds, texture packs, skin packs, and mash-ups for one low monthly price.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question2=What is a personal server?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer2=A personal server allows you to create a shared world that is always online and accessible from any device with Minecraft Marketplace. Players that you invite to your Realm can play this world at any time.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question3=Do my friends need to purchase Realms Plus to play on my Realm?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer3=Your friends don\xe2\x80\x99t need to purchase a Realms Plus subscription to play on your Realm. You can invite any friend (that has their multiplayer permissions enabled) to join your Realm for free.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question4=Which devices support Realms Plus for Minecraft?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer4=Realms Plus is currently available on any platform where you can install Minecraft Bedrock Edition. You can pl"
  result.add "ay Realms and use any content from Realms Plus on any of these devices if you\xe2\x80\x99re signed into your Microsoft account.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question5=How much does a Realms Plus subscription cost?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer5.contentSub=%s per month. Add infinite members, play online with 10 other players at the same time. Plus, enjoy a catalog of premium Marketplace content for free.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer5.contentSub.30days=%s per 30 days. Add infinite members, play online with 10 other players at the same time. Plus, enjoy a catalog of premium Marketplace content for free.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question6=How often are new packs added to Realms Plus?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer6=New packs are added to Realms Plus monthly.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question7=How long do I have access to Packs within Realms Plus?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer7=Realms Plus members enjoy unlimited access to a catalog of premium Minecraft add-ons, worlds, texture packs, skin packs, and mash-ups, until either the subscription expires, or a pack leaves the catalog.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question8=Where can I use Realms Plus packs?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer8=Worlds and packs included in the subscription can either be played online, played on your personal Realm, or played on a local device. You just need to play online once every 30 days to validate that your subscription is active.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question9=What happens to my Realms and worlds when my subscription expires?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer9=If your subscription ends, you and your friends will no longer be able to play online together on Realms, and you will no longer have access to Realms Plus packs. You can download any world saved to your Realm (within 18 months of ending your subscription). If you used Realms Plus worlds, texture packs, or mash-ups you will need to purchase those packs in the store or, if those packs are still in Realms Plus, re-subscribe, to play those world templates.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question10=Do I need Realms Plus and Marketplace Pass?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer10=No. Marketplace Pass is a catalog of premium content for you to enjoy. Realms Plus is a 10 player Realm with Marketplace Pass included. We suggest that you subscribe to the one that\xe2\x80\x99s right for you.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.question11=What is Realms Stories?\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.faq.answer11=Realms Stories is a social hub for your Realm. Post to the Story Feed to let others know what you\xe2\x80\x99re up to, and share your adventures and creations. Know who\xe2\x80\x99s who with a handy list of all the members. See when other members are playing to check out their creations or plan to join them next time.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.marketplacePass=Realms Plus includes Marketplace Pass!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.skinDescription=Change your look with skins!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.skinDescriptionPersona=Dress up with skins!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.skinDescriptionPersona.contentSub=Expand your wardrobe with skins!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.worldDescription=Explore popular content packs!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.worldDescription.contentSub=Play add-ons, themed worlds, and more!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.textureDescription=New visuals for your worlds!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.textureDescription.contentSub=Apply new visuals to your world! \x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.mashupDescription=Try a bit of everything in mash-ups!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.personaDescription=Customize your look with Character Creator items!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.personaDescription.contentSub=Collect monthly items in the dressing room!\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.recentlyAdded=Recently added\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.friendsGetAccess=Your Friends Get Access to the Content Used in Your Realm for Free\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.popularPacks=Popular Packs in Realms Plus:\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.viewAllPacks=VIEW ALL PACKS\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.content.contentDescription=Premium, curated creator-made content, including top-rated creations and player favorites.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.freeTrial=START FREE TRIAL\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.purchase.warningDialog.title=Notice\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.purchase.warningDialog.body=Realms Plus includes Marketplace Pass content. We suggest that you cancel your Marketplace Pass subscription after signing up for Realms Plus.\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.purchase.warningDialog.checkbox=I understand\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.purchase.warningDialog.button.back=Go Back\x0d\x0astore.realmsPlus.purchase.warningDialog.button.continue=Purchase\x0d\x0astore.csb.brand.1=MARKETPLACE\x0d\x0astore.csb.brand.2=PASS\x0d\x0astore.csb=Marketplace Pass\x0d\x0astore.csb.content=Content\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq=FAQ\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNow=SUBSCRIBE NOW \x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNowPerMonth=Purchase for %s/month\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNowPerMonth.30days=Purchase for %s/30 days\x0d\x0astore.csb.includedWithRealmsPlus=INCLUDED WITH REALMS PLUS\x0d\x0astore.csb.signInToSubscribe=Sign in to subscribe to Marketplace Pass\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNowTrialPerMonth=Start Trial \x0d\x0astore.csb.errorNoOffer=ERROR NO OFFER FOUND\x0d\x0astore.csb.manageSubscription=MANAGE SUBSCRIPTION\x0d\x0astore.csb.viewAllPacksTitle=A GREAT VALUE - PACKS WORTH OVER \xc2\xa7g$150 (USD)!\xc2\xa7r\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNow.buttonText=BUY FOR %s\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNow.viewTerms=TERMS & CONDITIONS\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNow.viewPrivacyPolicy=PRIVACY POLICY\x0d\x0astore.csb.buyNow.title=Start your Marketplace Pass Subscription\x0d\x0astore.csb.subscription=Monthly subscription to a wide variety of premium Minecraft Marketplace content. You\xe2\x80\x99ll be billed %s/month (subject to change) and can cancel to stop future charges at any time.\x0d\x0astore.csb.terms=Marketplace Pass is a subscription for content to be used with supported versions of Minecraft (game sold separately) on Windows and other supported platforms on which you own the game (Minecraft Java & Amazon Kindle Fire Editions not supported); an active subscription is required to use Marketplace Pass content. Content varies over time and may not be available in all countries. After the free trial period, subscription continues to be charged at the then-current regular price (subject to change) plus applicable taxes unless cancelled. You can cancel your subscription by accessing Services & subscriptions in your Microsoft account. If your subscription terminates or a content item is removed from the catalog, you must reactivate your subscription or buy the content separately to continue using it. ISP fees may apply. We may occasionally provide content that remains available to you even after the end of your subscription, in which case we reserve the right to take down such content if it becomes incompatible or if our rights to the content expire. Subscription subject to change and/or retirement. Subject to the Microsoft Services Agreement (www.microsoft.com/msa) and the Minecraft EULA (https://www.minecraft.net/eula). Any translations of these terms are done for your convenience only, and in the event of a dispute between the English and any non-English versions, the English version of these terms shall govern.\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.header=Start your Marketplace Pass Subscription\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.headerTrial=Free 30 Day Trial, then %s/month\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info=Monthly subscription for just %s includes:\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info.line1=Curated premium content\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info.line2=New, hand-picked content added every month\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info.line3=Add-ons, worlds, and more\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info.line4=Exclusive deals\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info.line5=Subscription renews automatically each month until canceled\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.info.line6=Cancel on the Subscriptions page of Minecraft Settings\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.beta=Beta\x0d\x0astore.csb.landing.preview=Preview\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.header=FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question1=What is Marketplace Pass?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer1=Monthly content subscription for just %s includes premium, curated community-made content.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question2=How often is content updated in Marketplace Pass?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer2=Select content refreshes each month so there\xe2\x80\x99s always something new to explore.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question3=What do I need to enjoy Marketplace Pass?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer3=Access to Marketplace Pass requires an active subscription, and a"
  result.add " compatible version of Minecraft: Bedrock Edition with Minecraft Marketplace.\xc2\xa0Requires Microsoft account sign-in.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question4=What happens to my content after it leaves Marketplace Pass?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer4=Once a world, texture pack, skin pack, or mash-up leaves the catalog, you will need to purchase the item from the Marketplace to continue playing. Packs will not be deleted from your local storage until you delete them. Monthly character creator items you\xe2\x80\x99ve redeemed are yours to keep.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question5=What happens when my subscription ends?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer5=You will be able to purchase and download any world templates saved to your cloud storage within 18 months of ending your subscription unless they are no longer offered by Minecraft. Monthly character creator items you\xe2\x80\x99ve redeemed are yours to keep.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question6=What's the difference between this and Realms Plus?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer6=The difference between the two subscriptions is that Realms Plus includes a personal server where you can play with up to ten friends at a time. The content catalog you have access to with your Marketplace Pass subscription is the same catalog that is available with a Realms Plus subscription.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question7=Can I subscribe to both Marketplace Pass and Realms Plus?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer7=A Realms Plus subscription includes Marketplace Pass. If you are subscribed to Marketplace Pass and want to explore Realms Plus, we suggest that you unsubscribe from Marketplace Pass first. Active Realms Plus subscribers are unable to subscribe to Marketplace Pass.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question8=Can I use my Marketplace Pass content on any device?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer8=If you purchase Marketplace Pass, you can access all the packs from any device with a  compatible version of Minecraft: Bedrock Edition with Minecraft Marketplace\xe2\x80\xaf(sold separately) if\xe2\x80\xafyou\xe2\x80\x99re signed into your Minecraft account. Not supported on Amazon Kindle Fire or Minecraft Java Edition.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question9=Can I play Marketplace Pass Content if I have joined the Minecraft Beta on Windows or XBOX?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer9=You will be able to see content in your subscription if you are already subscribed, but you will not be able to subscribe to Marketplace Pass from the Preview/BETA build.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.question10=Can I purchase the content offered within the marketplace pass catalog to own?\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.answer10=Yes, subscribers can save on content in the Marketplace Pass catalog - buy your favorites at a discounted rate before they leave the catalog to own them forever.\x0d\x0astore.csb.faq.bottom2=Visit our help site\x0d\x0astore.csb.contentPacks.worldDescription=Play add-ons, themed worlds, and more!\x0d\x0astore.csb.contentPacks.textureDescription=Apply new visuals to your world!\x0d\x0astore.csb.contentPacks.personaDescription=Collect monthly items in the dressing room!\x0d\x0astore.csb.contentPacks.skinDescription=Expand your wardrobe with skins!\xc2\xa0\x0d\x0astore.csb.contentPacks.mashupDescription=Try a bit of everything with mash-ups!\x0d\x0astore.csb.content.popularPacks=Discover Marketplace Pass\x0d\x0astore.csb.content.viewAllPacks=VIEW ALL PACKS\x0d\x0astore.csb.content.viewCharacterCreatorItems=VIEW CHARACTER CREATOR ITEMS\x0d\x0astore.csb.content.contentDescription=Premium, curated creator-made content, including top-rated creations and player favorites.\x0d\x0astore.csb.freeTrial=START FREE TRIAL\x0d\x0astore.csb.subscribed=Subscribed\x0d\x0astore.csb.welcomeDialog.title=Welcome to Marketplace Pass!\x0d\x0astore.csb.welcomeDialog.body=You can now enjoy premium, curated community-made content!\x0d\x0astore.csb.welcomeDialog.continue=Start browsing\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.warningDialog.title=Notice\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.warningDialog.body.line1=Marketplace Pass is included in your Realms Plus subscription.\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.warningDialog.body.line2=Please cancel your active Realms Plus subscription and then try purchasing.\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.warningDialog.button.back=Go Back\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.bestValue=BEST VALUE\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.leftBullet.1=Curated premium content\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.leftBullet.2=Refreshed every month\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.leftBullet.3=Exclusive deals\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.rightBullet.1=Personal 10 friend server\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.rightBullet.2=Friends play free\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.rightBullet.3=Includes\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.learnMore=Learn more\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.price=%s/Month\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.price.30days=%s/30 days\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.firstPeriodFree=Free 30 day trial!\x0d\x0astore.csb.upsell.realmsPlus=\xc2\xa7dREALMS PLUS\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchaseErrorDialog.title=Purchase Error\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchaseErrorDialog.body=We're having trouble processing your subscription right now. Please try again later. Thank you!\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchaseErrorDialog.back=Back\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchaseErrorDialog.errorCode=Error Code: %s\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchaseErrorDialog.correlationId=Correlation ID: %s\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.amazonDeviceWarning.title=Notice\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.amazonDeviceWarning.body.line1=Sorry! Marketplace Pass isn\xe2\x80\x99t available for purchase on Amazon devices at this time.\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.amazonDeviceWarning.body.line2=For any questions, please visit support.minecraft.net.\x0d\x0astore.csb.purchase.amazonDeviceWarning.button.back=Go Back\x0d\x0astore.csb.alreadySubscribed.toolTip=You already have a Marketplace Pass subscription.\x0d\x0astore.csb.banner.offer=Start your free 30 day trial now!\x0d\x0astore.csb.banner.learnMore=Learn more\x0d\x0astore.inventory.button=My Library\x0d\x0astore.inventory.title=My Library\x0d\x0astore.inventory.dropdown.owned=Owned\x0d\x0astore.inventory.dropdown.current