d Template\x0d\x0astore.popup.downloadWorldTemplateCell.download=Download Template Over Cellular\x0d\x0astore.popup.update.title.KB=Update Content? - %s KB\x0d\x0astore.popup.update.title.MB=Update Content? - %s MB\x0d\x0astore.popup.update.msg=This will update the %s on your device.\x0d\x0astore.popup.updateCell.title.KB=Update Over Cellular? - %s KB\x0d\x0astore.popup.updateCell.title.MB=Update Over Cellular? - %s MB\x0d\x0astore.popup.updateCell.msg=You are not connected to Wi-Fi. Do you want to update the %s on your device over your cellular network?\x0d\x0astore.popup.update.button1=Update\x0d\x0astore.popup.update.button2=Skip\x0d\x0astore.popup.update.back=Go Back\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseInProgress.title=Purchase in progress\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseInProgress.msg=This shouldn't take long.\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseFailed.title=Something Went Wrong\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseFailed.msg=Sorry, we were unable to complete your purchase. Maybe check your internet connection?\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchasePlatformStoreFailed.title=Error:\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchasePlatformStoreFailed.msg=Couldn\xe2\x80\x99t access the %s. Try again in a few minutes.\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchasePending.title=Still trying\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchasePending.msg=Sorry, we are still waiting for verification of your purchase. When it succeeds we will let you know!\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseFailedInsufficientFunds.title=You Need More Minecoins\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseFailedInsufficientFunds.msg=You do not have enough Minecoins to unlock this item. You can buy Minecoins from your app store.\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchaseFailedInsufficientFunds.buyButton=Get Minecoins\x0d\x0astore.popup.purchasePriceMismatch.msg=Sorry, we were unable to complete your purchase. Please try again later.\x0d\x0astore.popup.trialUpgradeFail.title=Game Unlock Error\x0d\x0astore.popup.trialUpgradeFail.msg=It looks like you are signed into a different Microsoft account from the one that first downloaded the Min