rating your model...\x0d\x0astructure_block.extensionDescription=Structure File\x0d\x0astructure_block.exportFileTitle=Export Structure\x0d\x0astructure_block.exportFailedTitle=Export Failed\x0d\x0astructure_block.exportFailedDescription=We failed to export the structure.\x0d\x0astructure_block.exportProgressTitle=Exporting Your Structure\x0d\x0astructure_block.importFileTitle=Import Structure\x0d\x0astructure_block.importFailedTitle=Import Failed\x0d\x0astructure_block.importFailedDescription=We failed to import the structure.\x0d\x0astructure_block.importProgressTitle=Importing Your Structure\x0d\x0astructure_block.exportFailedUnsupportedPlatform.message=Export operation not supported on this platform.\x0d\x0a3d_export.title=3D Export\x0d\x0a3d_export.include_players=Include Players:\x0d\x0a3d_export.remove_blocks=Remove Blocks:\x0d\x0a3d_export.off=Off\x0d\x0a3d_export.show=Show\x0d\x0a3d_export.include=Include\x0d\x0a3d_export.remove=Remove\x0d\x0a3d_export.export=Export\x0d\x0a3d_export.reset=Reset\x0d\x0a3d_export.remixServiceDiscontinued=Note: Remix3D Upload service is no longer available, use Export to save locally instead.\x0d\x0atitle.oldgl1=Old graphics card detected; this may prevent you from\x0d\x0atitle.oldgl2=playing in the future as OpenGL 2.0 will be required.\x0d\x0aeditorMode.text=coming soon\x0d\x0atranslation.test.args=%s %s\x0d\x0atranslation.test.complex=Prefix, %s%2$s again %s and %1$s lastly %s and also %1$s again!\x0d\x0atranslation.test.escape=%%s %%%s %%%%s %%%%%s\x0d\x0atranslation.test.invalid=hi %\x0d\x0atranslation.test.invalid2=hi %  s\x0d\x0atranslation.test.none=Hello, world!\x0d\x0atranslation.test.world=world\x0d\x0atypeface.mojangles=Mojangles\x0d\x0atypeface.notoSans=Noto Sans\x0d\x0aworldConversionErrorPrompt.title=World Conversion Failed\x0d\x0aworldConversionErrorPrompt.message=Oops, something went wrong during world conversion. Try again later.\x0d\x0aworldError.corrupted=is corrupted and can't be started.\x0d\x0aworldError.invalidArguments=was created with invalid arguments.\x0d\x0aworldError.IO=can't be opened.\x0d\x0aworldError.notFound=can't be found.\x0d\x0aworldError.notSupported=has an unsupported format.\x0d\x0aworldError.unknown=has an unknown problem.\x0d\x0aworldError.writeCorrupted=is corrupted and can't be saved.\x0d\x0aworldError.worldRecovered=World Recovered\x0d\x0aworldError.recoveredCorruptedWorld=Successfully recovered your corrupted world.\x0d\x0aworldError.recoveredCorruptedWorldWarning=Some of your most recent changes may have been lost in recovery.\x0d\x0aworldError.worldFailedRecovery=Recovery Failed\x0d\x0aworldError.worldFailedRecoveryText=We detected a corrupted world and failed to recover it.\x0d\x0awriteThrottling.osDialog.body=The requested operation is estimated to take %d minutes to complete. Please do not turn off your device during this time.\x0d\x0awriteThrottling.osDialog.cancel=Cancel Operation\x0d\x0awriteThrottling.osDialog.confirm=Proceed\x0d\x0awriteThrottling.progressBar.title=Preparing Data\x0d\x0awriteThrottling.progressBar.body=Getting your files ready...\x0d\x0auserData.recovered.title=Save Data Recovered\x0d\x0auserData.recovered.text=Successfully recovered your corrupted user se"
  result.add "ttings.\x0d\x0auserData.recovered.warning=Some of your most recent changes may have been lost in recovery.\x0d\x0auserData.unrecoverable.title=Save Data Recovery Failed\x0d\x0auserdata.unrecoverable.text=We detected that your user settings have become corrupted but failed to recover them.\x0d\x0atrial.pauseScreen.remainingTime=Remaining Trial Time: %s\x0d\x0atrial.pauseScreen.buyGame=Unlock Full Game\x0d\x0atrial.survival.welcome=Welcome to your Minecraft Trial!\x0d\x0atrial.survival.remainingTime=%d Minutes Remaining\x0d\x0atrial.pauseScreen.cb.buyGame=Frequently Asked Questions\x0d\x0atrial.noInvitesOrJoining=To play with friends please purchase the full game\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.trialLabel=Minecraft Trial\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.title=Let the trial begin!\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.description=In this trial you are limited to 90 minutes of play time. Craft, build, explore, and have fun! Your world will be preserved if you choose to purchase the full version.\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.description.updated=Explore, craft, build, and have fun! In this trial you will have 90 minutes of play time. Unlock the full game to continue playing as long as you want!\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.description.worldsDontTransferToFullGame.line1=Explore, craft, build, and have fun! In this trial you will have 90 minutes of play time. Unlock the full game to play an infinite amount of worlds for as long as you want!*\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.description.worldsDontTransferToFullGame.line2=*(This world will not transfer to the full game)\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.unlock=Unlock Full Game\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.startTrial=Start Trial\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.continueTrial=Continue Trial\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.cb.unlock=Frequently Asked Questions\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.cb.description.worldsDontTransferToFullGame.line1=Explore, craft, build, and have fun! In this trial world, you will have 90 minutes of play time. Uncover a bug? Report it at bugs.mojang.com! Other questions? Check out our FAQ.\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.cb.description.worldsDontTransferToFullGame.line2=(Trial worlds do not transfer to the full game.)\x0d\x0aratingPopUp.title=Are you enjoying Minecraft?\x0d\x0afeedbackPopup.title=Do you have any feedback for us?\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredDescription.line1=Time has expired. Please purchase to unlock the full game:\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredDescription.line2=-Explore limitless worlds\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredDescription.line3=-Play with your friends\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredDescription.line4=-Craft hundreds of items\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredDescription.line5=-Discover mysterious structures and realms\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredNewDescription=Do you want to continue exploring, crafting, and building? Unlock the full game to play as long as you want! This world will be saved for you to pick up where you left off but you can't modify it until you unlock the full game.\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredNewDescription.worldsDontTransferToFullGame.line1=Do you want to continue exploring, crafting, and building? Unlock the full game to play an infinite amount of worlds for as long as you want!*\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredTitle=Time's Up!\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.expiredViewWorld=View World\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.cb.expiredNewDescription.worldsDontTransferToFullGame.line1=Do you want to continue exploring, crafting, and building? Start a new trial world to continue playing!\x0d\x0atrial.upsell.cb.startNew=Start New World\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.title=Unlock Full Game\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.button=Buy Minecraft!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.buttonAlternate=Unlock Minecraft Full Game\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.minecraft.title=MINECRAFT \x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.minecraft.description=Endlessly explore your own unique worlds and construct anything you can imagine - from the simplest of homes to the grandest of castles! Play Creative mode to build wonders with unlimited resources. Or mine in Survival mode, crafting weapons and armor to fend off dangerous mobs and survive the nights. Plus, play with friends online! Unlock the full game today!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.xbl.title=MICROSOFT ACCOUNT\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.xbl.description=With the full Minecraft experience you get Creative mode, achievements, and more, plus with a Microsoft account you can meet others in the Minecraft community! Join your friends' worlds, make new friends on Servers, and sync your Marketplace purchases to everywhere you play Minecraft.\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.xbl.description.line2=*(in versions with Marketplace)\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.achievements.title=ACHIEVEMENTS\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.achievements.description=In addition to the full Minecraft experience with Creative mode, Multiplayer, and more, you'll earn achievements and a Gamerscore to mark your Minecraft progress and show your Microsoft account friends your accomplishments. Get the full game to start earning them!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.multiplayer.title=MULTIPLAYER\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.multiplayer.description=The full Minecraft experience lets you enjoy Creative mode, achievements and Multiplayer with your friends across Minecraft devices! Play with friends on console, PC and mobile to create, explore and survive together. Unlock the full Minecraft experience today!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.server.title=SERVERS\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.server.description=Servers offer some of the most creative ways to enjoy Minecraft! Play great mini-games, meet the Minecraft community and make new friends. Unlock the full Minecraft experience to try Servers today!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.store.title=STORE\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.store.description=Get access to Minecraft Marketplace, our in-game store. Switch up your look with new skins, change your world, or explore incredible new maps from the best community creators! Get the full game today!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.creative.title=CREATIVE\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.creative.description=Buy Minecraft and get Creative mode! Access the entire inventory - the only limit to what you can build is your imagination! Fly around your world, make your dream home out of anything and everything, or just blow up a mountain with unlimited TNT! \x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.addon.title=ADD-ONS\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.addon.description=Want to make wolves act like bunnies? Turn all the trees into cotton candy? You can alter everything in the full Minecraft experience with add-ons! Plus get access to Multiplayer, Creative mode, achievements and more! Buy Minecraft now for full access!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.seeds.title=SEEDS\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.seeds.description=Unlock the full Minecraft experience and get access to Seeds! Seeds help you discover new biomes - survive on ice plains, ascend extreme hills, or trek across deserts. Start with unique templates or explore random new worlds! Access Seeds, Creative mode, Multiplayer and more by buying Minecraft today!\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.title=Thanks for Testing\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.button=Take me to the FAQ!\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.minecraft.title=MINECRAFT TRIAL\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.minecraft.description=Thank you for downloading the Minecraft Trial for Chromebook! Your playtesting will provide invaluable data for bug fixes and technical troubleshooting. Uncover a bug? Report it at bugs.mojang.com! Other questions? Check out our FAQ.\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.xbl.title=MICROSOFT ACCOUNT\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.xbl.description=With the full Minecraft experience, you get Creative mode, achievements, and more, plus with a Microsoft account you can meet others in the Minecraft community! You\xe2\x80\x99ll be able to join friends\xe2\x80\x99 worlds, make new friends on Servers, and sync your Marketplace purchases to everywhere you play Minecraft.\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.xbl.description.line2=*(in versions with Marketplace)\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.achievements.description=In addition to the full Minecraft experience with Creative mode, Multiplayer, and more, you'll earn achievements and a Gamerscore to mark your Minecraft progress and show your Microsoft account friends your accomplishments.\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.multiplayer.description=The full Minecraft experience lets you enjoy Creative mode, achievements and Multiplayer with your friends across Minecraft devices! Play with friends on console, PC and mobile to create, explore and survive together.\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.server.description=As a part of the full Minecraft experience, Servers offer some of the most creative ways to enjoy M"
  result.add "inecraft! Play great mini-games, meet the Minecraft community and make new friends.\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.store.description=The full game allows access to Minecraft Marketplace, our in-game store. Switch up your look with new skins, change your world, or explore incredible new maps from the best community creators!\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.creative.description=A beloved part of the full Minecraft experience: Creative mode! Access the entire inventory - the only limit to what you can build is your imagination! Fly around your world, make your dream home out of anything and everything, or just blow up a mountain with unlimited TNT!\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.addon.description=Want to make wolves act like bunnies? Turn all the trees into cotton candy? You can alter everything in the full Minecraft experience with add-ons! Plus get access to Multiplayer, Creative mode, achievements and more!\x0d\x0atrial.thanks_for_testing.seeds.description=The full Minecraft experience unlocks access to Seeds! Seeds help you discover new biomes - survive on ice plains, ascend extreme hills, or trek across deserts. Start with unique templates or explore random new worlds!\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.navleft=Navigate Tab Left\x0d\x0atrial.tabbed_upsell.navRight=Navigate Tab Right\x0d\x0atrial.starter.collection.title=Minecraft Starter Collection\x0d\x0atrial.master.collection.title=Minecraft Master Collection\x0d\x0atrial.starter.collection.button=Buy Starter Collection\x0d\x0atrial.master.collection.button=Buy Master Collection\x0d\x0atrial.starter.offer=Get Minecraft, 700 Minecoins, 2 skin packs, 1 texture pack and 1 mash-up\x0d\x0atrial.master.offer=Get Minecraft, 1000 Minecoins, 4 skin packs, 2 texture packs, 3 maps, and 1 mash-up\x0d\x0atrial.collection.1.title=1000 Minecoins\x0d\x0atrial.collection.1.description=Buy skins, textures and worlds in the Marketplace!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.2.title=700 Minecoins\x0d\x0atrial.collection.2.description=Buy skins, textures and worlds in the Marketplace!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.3.title=Wildlife: Savanna\x0d\x0atrial.collection.3.description=Go on safari in a rugged off-road vehicle that seats 4!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.4.title=Adventurer's Dream\x0d\x0atrial.collection.4.description=Explore Noxcrew's magical world full of ancient castles!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.5.title=PureBDcraft Pack\x0d\x0atrial.collection.5.description=Transform your Minecraft world into a comic!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.6.title=Relics of Privateers\x0d\x0atrial.collection.6.description=Vast tropical wilderness on a whirlwind hunt for treasure!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.7.title=Greek Mythology Mash-up\x0d\x0atrial.collection.7.description=Explore an ancient world, texture pack and skins!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.8.title=Winter Mini-Games Festival\x0d\x0atrial.collection.8.description=Playgrounds filled with games and challenges!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.9.title=Pastel Skin Pack\x0d\x0atrial.collection.9.description=Get ready for an explosion of rainbow pastel happiness!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.10.title=Plastic Texture Pack\x0d\x0atrial.collection.10.description=Make your worlds simple, colorful and vibrant!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.11.title=Skin Pack 1\x0d\x0atrial.collection.11.description=Customize your character with this selection of skins!\x0d\x0atrial.collection.12.title=Villains Skin Pack\x0d\x0atrial.collection.12.description=Dress as a Cake Maniac, Frankencrafter, or Worse!\x0d\x0atrial.includes=Includes\x0d\x0atrial.survival.mode.title=SURVIVAL\x0d\x0atrial.creative.mode.title=CREATIVE\x0d\x0atrial.survival.mode.1.intro_description=The original Minecraft experience: collect resources to craft tools and build structures, find and farm food to manage your hunger, battle dangerous mobs, and explore a vast world.\x0d\x0atrial.survival.mode.2.intro_description=Start by collecting some wood and dirt for a makeshift home to help you survive the first night! From there it's all up to you.\x0d\x0atrial.creative.mode.1.intro_description=Build anything you can imagine in Creative Mode. Take no damage, fly through the skies, and enjoy instant access to every block in the game! This mode lets you focus on crafting and gives you everything you need to build something beautiful!\x0d\x0atrial.creative.mode.2.intro_description=You'll also have access to Inspiration Island, a tutorial world and introduction to Creative mode that'll teach you how to be a master builder in no time! You can find more great worlds like this in Minecraft Marketplace.\x0d\x0atrial.tour.marketplace=TOUR THE MARKETPLACE\x0d\x0atrial.world.title=Which Trial World?\x0d\x0atutorial.edu.menuTitle=Learn to Play\x0d\x0atutorial.edu.title=Tutorials\x0d\x0autility.zipFile=Zip File\x0d\x0autility.pdfFile=PDF File\x0d\x0averification.nolicense.title=License Error\x0d\x0averification.nolicense.description=We're having trouble verifying that you own Minecraft on this device. Make sure you have downloaded and installed Minecraft from the store. Or simply reconnect to the internet and try again.\x0d\x0aautosave.title=Autosave\x0d\x0aautosave.info.general=When you see this icon, we are saving your game. Do not turn off your device while this icon is on screen.\x0d\x0aautosave.info.xbox=When you see this icon, we are saving your game. Do not turn off your Xbox while this icon is on screen.\x0d\x0aautosave.info.desktop=When you see this icon, we are saving your game. Do not turn off your computer while this icon is on screen.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.error=Please sign in with your Microsoft account to play with friends, earn gamerscore and achievements.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.error.pocket.line1=Thanks for testing Realms! The features are not final and you might run into bugs. Send us feedback! We're listening.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.error.pocket.line2=\x0d\x0axbox.signin.error.pocket.line3=During this test, everyone will need to sign in with a Microsoft account so they can be sent invites and added to Realms.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.warning.kickPlayer=This will send you back to the main menu. Continue?\x0d\x0axbox.connection.error=Disconnected from Microsoft account\x0d\x0axbox.signin=Sign In\x0d\x0axbox.signin.qr=Two ways to Sign In\x0d\x0axbox.signin.qr.left.header=Scan the QR Code\x0d\x0axbox.signin.qr.left.body=Use your camera app or a QR code reader on your device.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.qr.right.header=Or visit the website\x0d\x0axbox.signin.qr.account=Sign in or create a free Microsoft account to play online with your friends and save purchases across platforms, access Realms, and more.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.beta.blocked=Signing in with a Microsoft account is not available on the beta at this time.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.enterCode=And enter this code:\x0d\x0axbox.signin.enterCode.qr=2. Enter the code below when prompted:\x0d\x0axbox.signin.letsPlay=Let's Play!\x0d\x0axbox.signin.message=Sign in with your Free Microsoft account to experience the full world of Minecraft.\x0d\x0axbox.signin.url=https://microsoft.com/link\x0d\x0axbox.signin.useDifferentAccount=Sign in with a different Microsoft account\x0d\x0axbox.signin.website=Visit this website on another device:\x0d\x0axbox.signin.website.qr=1. Visit this website on another device:\x0d\x0axbox.signin.welcome=Welcome!\x0d\x0axbox.signin.newaccount.welcome=Welcome!\x0d\x0axbox.signin.newaccount.info=Your friends and their friends can see if you're online. your game clips, and your recent apps and games. You can change these on Xbox.com.\x0d\x0axbox.signinFirst=Sign In First\x0d\x0axbox.signinFree=Sign In For Free\x0d\x0axbox.signout=Sign Out\x0d\x0axbox.signinquestion=Sign In?\x0d\x0axbox.notnow=Not Now\x0d\x0axbox.signingin=Signing in with your Microsoft account...\x0d\x0axbox.signingin.offline=Signing in\x0d\x0axbox.failedsignin.body=We could not sign you into your Microsoft account. Access to Realms, Profiles, and your Marketplace items will be limited. Please try again later.\x0d\x0axbox.failedsignin.error=Error Code:\x0d\x0axbox.failedsignin.moreInfo=More Info\x0d\x0axbox.dev_wrongSandboxSigninFailed.title=Something Went Wrong\x0d\x0axbox.dev_wrongSandboxSigninFailed.line1=Failed to sign in to %s sandbox. Please change sandboxes and restart Minecraft or sign in with a different account. Sandbox will be %s on restart. \x0d\x0axbox.dev_wrongSandboxSigninFailed.button.dev=Change To Dev Sandbox\x0d\x0axbox.dev_wrongSandboxSigninFailed.button.retail=Change To Retail Sandbox\x0d\x0axbox.dev_wrongSandboxSigninFailed.button.clearXbl=Clear Account Sign in Data\x0d\x0axbox.thirdpartysignin.line1=Awesome mini-games and new players are waiting for you! But first, '%s' would like to know who you are.\x0d\x0axbox.thirdpartysignin.line2=You need to sign in with a Microsoft account to connect!\x0d\x0axbox.signInLong=Sign in for Fr"
  result.add "ee!\x0d\x0axbox.signOutLong=Sign out of your Microsoft account\x0d\x0axbox.disconectionscreen.notSignedIn=Sign in with your Microsoft account to play with friends.\x0d\x0axbox.disconectionscreen.multiplayerNotAllowed=This Microsoft account does not have permission to join multiplayer games.\x0d\x0axbox.disconectionscreen.accessDenied=You must be friends with someone in this game in order to join.\x0d\x0axbox.profile.addFriend=Add Friend\x0d\x0axbox.profile.addFriend.success=Success! %s was added to your friend list.\x0d\x0axbox.profile.block=Block\x0d\x0axbox.profile.currentlyPlaying=Currently playing %s\x0d\x0axbox.profile.favorite=Favorite\x0d\x0axbox.profile.favoriteHelperText=Favorite friends go first on your friends list. You'll see when they go online or start broadcasting.\x0d\x0axbox.profile.friend=Friend\x0d\x0axbox.profile.friendHelperText=Follow %s. After you both are friends, you can invite them to your game.\x0d\x0axbox.profile.mute=Mute\x0d\x0axbox.profile.realName=Manage your privacy settings for sharing your real name in the Xbox app.\x0d\x0axbox.profile.removeFriend=Unfriend\x0d\x0axbox.profile.report=Report\x0d\x0axbox.profile.errorModal=An issue occurred while attempting to open the Player profile. Error Code: %d\x0d\x0axbox.report.gamertag=Report %s\x0d\x0axbox.report.optionalText=Enter Text Here (optional)\x0d\x0axbox.report.toast=You have reported %s\x0d\x0axbox.report.toastError=We were unable to send your report. Try again soon.\x0d\x0axbox.report.whereReport=Where did you observe the bad behavior?\x0d\x0axbox.report.whereReportDescription=Please let us know where the incident took place. This will help us in researching your case.\x0d\x0axbox.report.whyReport=Why are you reporting %s?\x0d\x0axbox.report.area.chat=Chat message\x0d\x0axbox.report.area.skin=Player skin\x0d\x0axbox.report.area.gameplay=Gameplay\x0d\x0axbox.report.area.ingame=In-game creations\x0d\x0axbox.report.cyberbullying=Cyberbullying\x0d\x0axbox.report.falseRe