emeViolence=Extreme Violence or Gore\x0d\x0axbox.report.quittingEarly=Quitting early\x0d\x0axbox.report.unsportingBehavior=Unsporting behavior\x0d\x0axbox.report.voiceCommunication=Voice communication\x0d\x0axbox.statistics.timePlayed=Time played\x0d\x0axbox.statistics.blocksBroken=Blocks broken\x0d\x0axbox.statistics.distanceTravelled=Distance traveled\x0d\x0axbox.statistics.mobsDefeated=Mobs defeated\x0d\x0asafety.muted.title=You've been temporarily muted in chat.\x0d\x0asafety.muted.message=Remember to follow the Minecraft Community Standards.\x0d\x0asafety.bannedSkin.title=Skin Not Allowed In Multiplayer\x0d\x0asafety.bannedSkin.button=Learn More\x0d\x0asafety.bannedSkin.continue=Continue with default skin\x0d\x0asafety.bannedSkin=Your current skin violates our Community Standards. Please select a different skin to join a multiplayer game. Click \x22%s\x22 to view our Community Standards or submit a case review for your current skin.\x0d\x0asafety.textProcessorOffline.message=\xc2\xa7eChat and other user generated text is not available right now. Please try again later.\xc2\xa7f\x0d\x0aauthserver.notavailable=Something went wrong. We can't verify that the server you are trying to connect to is one that we trust. We recommend that you try again later.\x0d\x0aauthserver.authfailed=This is bad. This server failed our verification test. Someone we don't trust might be pretending to be a trusted server.\x0d\x0aplatform.model.unknown=UNKNOWN\x0d\x0acompliance.playtime.greaterThan24Hours=You've been playing for greater than 24 hours\x0d\x0acompliance.playtime.message=Excessive gaming may interfere with normal daily life\x0d\x0acompliance.playtime.multipleHours=You've been playing for %d hours\x0d\x0acompliance.playtime.oneHour=You've been playing for 1 hour\x0d\x0apackdiscoveryerror.manifest_pack_error=Unable to open pack.\x0d\x0apackdiscoveryerror.incomplete_pack=Incomplete pack.\x0d\x0apackdiscoveryerror.unsupported_file_format=Not a valid zip archive.\x0d\x0apackdis